WEBVTT

00:00:06.098 --> 00:00:08.100 line:80%
[♪ theme music playing]

00:00:33.917 --> 00:00:35.002 line:80%
IN YOUR RADIANT SEASON

00:00:38.088 --> 00:00:39.631 line:80%
CHARACTERS, EVENTS, ORGANIZATIONS,
AND PLACES IN THIS DRAMA ARE FICTITIOUS

00:00:39.715 --> 00:00:41.008 line:80%
ALL CHILD ACTORS AND ANIMALS
FILMED IN A SAFE ENVIRONMENT

00:00:43.344 --> 00:00:45.179 line:80%
Mom, don't go.

00:00:46.055 --> 00:00:47.222 line:80%
Let me come with you!

00:00:48.974 --> 00:00:50.184 line:80%
[suitcase wheels scraping]

00:00:50.267 --> 00:00:52.311 line:80%
Mom…

00:00:52.394 --> 00:00:54.480 line:80%
[♪ soft emotional music playing]

00:00:54.563 --> 00:00:55.731 line:80%
[metallic clang]

00:00:56.398 --> 00:00:57.983 line:80%
Let me keep this, Dad.

00:00:59.610 --> 00:01:01.695 line:80%
Dad… [grunts]

00:01:04.365 --> 00:01:07.576 line:80%
[Chan's dad] You shouldn't accept kids
without their parents' permission!

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:09.578 line:80%
-I…
-Come with me.

00:01:14.166 --> 00:01:16.377 line:80%
[men speaking indistinctly]

00:01:16.460 --> 00:01:17.461 line:80%
[softly in English] Okay.

00:01:17.544 --> 00:01:19.588 line:80%
[in Korean] Dad! Dad!

00:01:19.672 --> 00:01:22.049 line:80%
I promise not to draw anymore, so…

00:01:22.925 --> 00:01:24.510 line:80%
So please let me stay in Korea.

00:01:26.553 --> 00:01:27.554 line:80%
[breath trembling]

00:01:28.847 --> 00:01:31.725 line:20%
EPISODE 3

00:01:31.892 --> 00:01:33.811 line:20%
[♪ soft emotional music continues]

00:01:33.894 --> 00:01:36.021 line:20%
[indistinct chatter]

00:01:50.703 --> 00:01:52.287 line:20%
[in English] I'll see you. Excuse me.

00:01:58.627 --> 00:01:59.628 line:20%
[♪ music fades]

00:02:09.638 --> 00:02:11.724 line:80%
Are you using this room by yourself?

00:02:13.225 --> 00:02:16.186 line:80%
No, I have a roommate,
but he's traveling right now.

00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:19.565 line:80%
Do you want a drink?

00:02:28.866 --> 00:02:29.867 line:80%
[cups thud]

00:02:40.586 --> 00:02:42.129 line:80%
Father…

00:02:48.510 --> 00:02:50.387 line:80%
That's just…

00:02:50.471 --> 00:02:52.681 line:80%
[♪ tense music playing]

00:02:52.765 --> 00:02:53.891 line:80%
[breath trembling]

00:03:16.955 --> 00:03:17.956 line:80%
[sighs]

00:03:24.171 --> 00:03:25.881 line:80%
[objects clatter]

00:03:31.053 --> 00:03:36.392 line:80%
[grunting angrily]

00:03:46.110 --> 00:03:48.153 line:80%
How long are you going to keep doing this?

00:03:48.237 --> 00:03:50.990 line:80%
What more do I have to do
to make you stop?

00:03:53.158 --> 00:03:54.326 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:03:54.994 --> 00:03:57.204 line:80%
[breath trembling]

00:03:57.287 --> 00:03:58.872 line:80%
[door slams shut]

00:04:04.753 --> 00:04:06.755 line:80%
[♪ somber music playing]

00:04:13.262 --> 00:04:15.264 line:80%
[breathes shakily]

00:04:27.109 --> 00:04:29.111 line:80%
[crying]

00:04:45.085 --> 00:04:47.087 line:80%
[Chan] <i>I kept forcing myself to hang on,</i>

00:04:48.130 --> 00:04:50.758 line:80%
<i>but I couldn't find</i>
<i>any reason to keep going,</i>

00:04:51.467 --> 00:04:54.094 line:80%
<i>so I eventually decided to end it all.</i>

00:04:57.848 --> 00:04:59.933 line:80%
[pinging]

00:05:00.684 --> 00:05:04.730 line:80%
<i>-But then she disturbed me really loudly.</i>
-[♪ music fades]

00:05:04.813 --> 00:05:06.982 line:80%
[inhales sharply, groans]

00:05:07.066 --> 00:05:08.484 line:80%
[pinging continues]

00:05:09.026 --> 00:05:10.027 line:80%
[sighs]

00:05:10.861 --> 00:05:12.237 line:80%
[groans]

00:05:13.405 --> 00:05:14.782 line:20%
Ran
CHAN, CHAN, CHAN!

00:05:14.865 --> 00:05:15.866 line:80%
Oh…

00:05:15.949 --> 00:05:17.451 line:80%
[Haran] <i>The pen you sent me</i>
<i>for my birthday…</i>

00:05:17.534 --> 00:05:21.538 line:80%
<i>I used it to draw a design,</i>
<i>and it won in our company contest!</i>

00:05:21.622 --> 00:05:24.124 line:80%
<i>-Let's go!</i>
-[Chan] It won?

00:05:24.208 --> 00:05:26.210 line:80%
[Haran] <i>Thank you so much!</i>

00:05:26.293 --> 00:05:27.294 line:80%
<i>You know,</i>

00:05:27.878 --> 00:05:29.421 line:80%
<i>you're my savior.</i>

00:05:30.422 --> 00:05:31.465 line:80%
"You're…

00:05:34.218 --> 00:05:35.260 line:80%
my savior."

00:05:35.928 --> 00:05:39.264 line:80%
<i>And that disruption</i>
<i>gave me an opportunity.</i>

00:05:40.140 --> 00:05:42.351 line:80%
<i>An opportunity to live again.</i>

00:05:42.434 --> 00:05:45.938 line:80%
-[♪ optimistic music playing]
-[laptop pings]

00:05:46.021 --> 00:05:47.022 line:80%
Ran
DARN IT!

00:05:51.360 --> 00:05:53.278 line:80%
[Haran] <i>Oh, gosh. They said it's a fake.</i>

00:05:53.362 --> 00:05:56.532 line:80%
<i>That Gold-something that helps you sleep.</i>
<i>I heard there's no proof.</i>

00:05:56.615 --> 00:05:58.242 line:80%
<i>I should've looked into it</i>
<i>before telling you.</i>

00:05:58.325 --> 00:06:00.327 line:80%
[♪ "Goldberg Variations, BWV 988: Aria"
plays on speakers]

00:06:00.411 --> 00:06:01.745 line:80%
-[mouse clicks]
-[♪ music stops]

00:06:09.753 --> 00:06:10.754 line:80%
[mouse clicks]

00:06:10.838 --> 00:06:12.840 line:80%
[♪ Baroque music continues on earphones]

00:06:19.304 --> 00:06:21.765 line:80%
[sighs] <i>Why did it suddenly get so lively?</i>

00:06:21.849 --> 00:06:24.226 line:80%
<i>It's like music to wake you up.</i>

00:06:24.310 --> 00:06:25.894 line:80%
<i>I'm so sorry.</i>

00:06:29.606 --> 00:06:31.108 line:80%
[keyboard clacking]

00:06:31.191 --> 00:06:32.276 line:80%
[pings]

00:06:34.903 --> 00:06:36.196 line:80%
[Haran] <i>Shocking news.</i>

00:06:36.280 --> 00:06:38.490 line:80%
<i>I was eating lunch with my teammates,</i>

00:06:38.574 --> 00:06:39.742 line:80%
<i>and there was…</i>

00:06:39.825 --> 00:06:41.702 line:20%
<i>dun dun, eggplant in it.</i>

00:06:41.785 --> 00:06:42.911 line:80%
<i>Gross.</i>

00:06:45.247 --> 00:06:46.248 line:80%
[Chan] <i>Eggplant?</i>

00:06:46.332 --> 00:06:50.127 line:80%
[Haran] <i>It's all mushy and squishy,</i>
<i>and it's neon-colored. Yuck! </i>[retches]

00:06:50.210 --> 00:06:51.670 line:80%
<i>The taste of a neon alien. </i>[retches]

00:06:51.754 --> 00:06:53.756 line:80%
[♪ Baroque music continues]

00:07:01.513 --> 00:07:02.598 line:80%
[Chan] Mmm.

00:07:04.600 --> 00:07:06.060 line:80%
A neon alien…

00:07:06.644 --> 00:07:09.938 line:80%
<i>I laughed properly for the first time</i>
<i>thanks to her.</i>

00:07:10.022 --> 00:07:11.023 line:80%
[rain pattering]

00:07:11.607 --> 00:07:13.692 line:80%
<i>I used to be trapped in a tiny world,</i>

00:07:13.776 --> 00:07:17.655 line:80%
<i>-and it grew wider because of her.</i>
-[♪ pleasant music playing]

00:07:18.572 --> 00:07:19.573 line:80%
[sighs]

00:07:19.657 --> 00:07:22.076 line:80%
[Chan] <i>But that person</i>
<i>who laughed and shone so brightly…</i>

00:07:23.494 --> 00:07:24.578 line:80%
<i>keeps crying now.</i>

00:07:25.704 --> 00:07:26.872 line:80%
<i>She keeps hiding.</i>

00:07:26.955 --> 00:07:27.956 line:80%
[sighs]

00:07:28.040 --> 00:07:30.417 line:80%
[Chan] <i>I want to do the same for her now</i>

00:07:30.501 --> 00:07:33.462 line:80%
<i>and help her live joyfully again.</i>

00:07:34.254 --> 00:07:38.676 line:80%
<i>Because she was a grateful disruption</i>
<i>that made me live again.</i>

00:07:40.969 --> 00:07:44.682 line:80%
Is it okay if I start being
really nice to you from now on?

00:07:47.309 --> 00:07:48.310 line:80%
[chuckles softly]

00:07:50.604 --> 00:07:51.605 line:80%
No,

00:07:52.314 --> 00:07:53.565 line:80%
you can't.

00:07:53.649 --> 00:07:54.650 line:80%
What?

00:07:55.275 --> 00:07:56.318 line:80%
Why?

00:07:56.402 --> 00:07:57.569 line:80%
Oh, right.

00:07:57.653 --> 00:07:59.905 line:80%
I just want to repay you for what you did.

00:08:02.282 --> 00:08:05.035 line:80%
If it's because of those clothes,
it's fine.

00:08:05.661 --> 00:08:08.831 line:80%
I have no intention
of getting close to anyone.

00:08:12.751 --> 00:08:14.211 line:80%
What if there's a time limit?

00:08:16.630 --> 00:08:18.257 line:80%
[♪ lighthearted music playing]

00:08:18.340 --> 00:08:19.466 line:80%
I…

00:08:20.217 --> 00:08:22.219 line:80%
I just meant…

00:08:23.137 --> 00:08:26.849 line:80%
We can be friends while I'm in Korea.

00:08:27.599 --> 00:08:30.060 line:80%
[chuckles softly] Just for three months.

00:08:33.397 --> 00:08:34.398 line:80%
[sighs softly]

00:08:38.360 --> 00:08:40.404 line:80%
We'll keep seeing each other
at work and at SHIM.

00:08:40.487 --> 00:08:41.530 line:80%
So…

00:08:41.613 --> 00:08:43.866 line:80%
"Let's live so I won't have any regrets."

00:08:43.949 --> 00:08:45.659 line:80%
You said that was your motto.

00:08:45.743 --> 00:08:48.537 line:80%
"Let's not get close to anyone.
Then nothing will happen."

00:08:49.079 --> 00:08:50.664 line:80%
That's my motto.

00:08:51.498 --> 00:08:55.711 line:80%
I'll get along with you very well
as a colleague.

00:08:55.794 --> 00:08:59.131 line:80%
But I will never get close
to you personally.

00:09:01.425 --> 00:09:02.426 line:80%
[pings]

00:09:06.722 --> 00:09:08.057 line:80%
A three-month trial!

00:09:08.140 --> 00:09:09.808 line:80%
[stutters]

00:09:09.892 --> 00:09:11.894 line:80%
You know, like free trials
in apps and games.

00:09:12.561 --> 00:09:13.979 line:80%
There's nothing to lose.

00:09:14.855 --> 00:09:16.732 line:80%
You can use me as a friend
when you're bored

00:09:16.815 --> 00:09:18.651 line:80%
or a misunderstanding for Ms. Kim.

00:09:19.151 --> 00:09:20.736 line:80%
Just try me out as a free trial.

00:09:21.487 --> 00:09:25.991 line:80%
As soon as the three months is over,
I'll disappear without a trace.

00:09:28.661 --> 00:09:30.412 line:80%
All right, fine.

00:09:32.498 --> 00:09:34.375 line:80%
You really don't want to be friends?

00:09:34.458 --> 00:09:36.085 line:80%
[sighs] No.

00:09:37.586 --> 00:09:40.381 line:80%
Okay. I understand.

00:09:41.006 --> 00:09:43.676 line:80%
Then, I'll make you want
to become my friend.

00:09:44.718 --> 00:09:45.928 line:80%
-Excuse me?
-Mmm.

00:09:46.011 --> 00:09:48.013 line:80%
[♪ sentimental song playing]

00:09:48.639 --> 00:09:50.057 line:80%
I hope you get better soon.

00:09:52.309 --> 00:09:53.310 line:80%
What…

00:09:53.894 --> 00:09:55.896 line:80%
-[chuckling]
-[signal light beeping]

00:09:59.608 --> 00:10:00.609 line:80%
[sighs defeatedly]

00:10:05.447 --> 00:10:06.448 line:80%
[coughs]

00:10:09.326 --> 00:10:10.327 line:80%
[sighs]

00:10:12.079 --> 00:10:15.249 line:80%
HERBAL TEA

00:10:23.257 --> 00:10:25.217 line:80%
[sighs wearily]

00:10:28.095 --> 00:10:30.431 line:80%
[breathes deeply]

00:10:40.149 --> 00:10:41.150 line:80%
[sighs]

00:10:46.530 --> 00:10:47.614 line:80%
[sighs frustratingly]

00:10:54.288 --> 00:10:55.289 line:80%
[sobs]

00:10:56.915 --> 00:10:58.917 line:80%
[♪ song continues]

00:11:01.962 --> 00:11:04.715 line:80%
[Chan breathes deeply]

00:11:06.675 --> 00:11:07.968 line:80%
[sighs]

00:11:11.930 --> 00:11:13.015 line:80%
[chuckles softly]

00:11:21.273 --> 00:11:23.192 line:80%
[wind whooshing]

00:11:23.275 --> 00:11:25.986 line:80%
-[leaves rustling]
-[bird chirping]

00:11:26.070 --> 00:11:28.197 line:80%
IN YOUR RADIANT SEASON

00:11:28.739 --> 00:11:29.740 line:80%
Haran.

00:11:29.823 --> 00:11:30.824 line:80%
[♪ song fades]

00:11:35.329 --> 00:11:36.872 line:80%
[birds chirping]

00:11:36.955 --> 00:11:39.375 line:80%
Geez. Are you a bear?

00:11:39.458 --> 00:11:41.210 line:80%
You're sleeping in the cave now?

00:11:41.835 --> 00:11:44.254 line:80%
[sighs] I fell asleep.

00:11:45.089 --> 00:11:47.216 line:80%
Come downstairs.

00:11:47.299 --> 00:11:48.842 line:80%
I have something to announce.

00:11:50.594 --> 00:11:54.515 line:80%
First of all, thank you
for gathering early in the morning.

00:11:54.598 --> 00:11:57.810 line:80%
Please understand,
since I'm a busy high school senior.

00:11:57.893 --> 00:11:59.895 line:80%
I'm sleepy. Just get to the point, please.

00:12:01.563 --> 00:12:03.023 line:80%
Okay, I will.

00:12:05.401 --> 00:12:06.527 line:80%
I'm going to get married.

00:12:07.903 --> 00:12:13.450 line:80%
Mmm. You're always planning things,
but aren't you planning way too far ahead?

00:12:13.534 --> 00:12:17.663 line:80%
No, I want to get married in a few months.

00:12:18.414 --> 00:12:19.415 line:80%
[Hayeong inhales sharply]

00:12:20.124 --> 00:12:22.167 line:80%
-With whom?
-My boyfriend.

00:12:22.251 --> 00:12:25.421 line:80%
What do you mean?
How can you just get married…

00:12:26.046 --> 00:12:27.047 line:80%
[gasps]

00:12:28.173 --> 00:12:29.341 line:80%
[in English] Wait a minute.

00:12:29.425 --> 00:12:32.636 line:80%
[in Korean] I trust you,
but this is really sudden,

00:12:32.720 --> 00:12:35.055 line:80%
so I'm asking just in case.

00:12:35.139 --> 00:12:37.933 line:80%
-Are you…
-Don't be ridiculous.

00:12:38.017 --> 00:12:41.270 line:80%
We've been dating purely
without crossing the line.

00:12:41.353 --> 00:12:43.063 line:80%
Don't even think about it.

00:12:43.147 --> 00:12:45.399 line:80%
Tell me. Who is he?

00:12:45.482 --> 00:12:47.609 line:80%
I've known him since elementary school.

00:12:47.693 --> 00:12:50.612 line:80%
Cha Yougyum.
He's in our school's baseball team.

00:12:50.696 --> 00:12:55.117 line:80%
[scoffs] He should focus on baseball
instead of seducing our innocent Hadam.

00:12:55.743 --> 00:12:58.787 line:80%
He's an innocent guy
who only thinks about baseball and me.

00:12:58.871 --> 00:13:00.539 line:80%
I'm the one who suggested marriage.

00:13:00.622 --> 00:13:04.335 line:80%
Fine, let's say you get married.
How will you make a living?

00:13:04.418 --> 00:13:07.379 line:80%
He's joining the Major League.
He's joining the New York Comets.

00:13:07.463 --> 00:13:08.547 line:80%
It was on the news.

00:13:09.131 --> 00:13:10.341 line:80%
The Comets?

00:13:10.424 --> 00:13:14.053 line:80%
So are you saying
you'll give up your studies

00:13:14.136 --> 00:13:16.263 line:80%
and go to the US with him?

00:13:16.347 --> 00:13:20.225 line:80%
No, I'm going to medical school here
like I planned.

00:13:20.309 --> 00:13:24.271 line:80%
I want us to get married
so I won't feel anxious when he's away.

00:13:24.355 --> 00:13:26.190 line:80%
Things won't change much right away.

00:13:26.273 --> 00:13:29.151 line:80%
[groans] She planned everything already.

00:13:29.234 --> 00:13:30.402 line:80%
Hey, Hadam.

00:13:30.486 --> 00:13:32.780 line:80%
You don't know much about life yet, so--

00:13:32.863 --> 00:13:34.448 line:80%
Wait.

00:13:34.531 --> 00:13:35.866 line:80%
Let me meet him first.

00:13:35.949 --> 00:13:38.118 line:80%
-[♪ upbeat music playing]
-Grandma!

00:13:39.119 --> 00:13:40.162 line:80%
All right.

00:13:40.245 --> 00:13:43.374 line:80%
He's in Jeju Island for a competition,
so I'll bring him home after.

00:13:43.457 --> 00:13:47.086 line:80%
Okay. We'll discuss this after I meet him.

00:13:48.587 --> 00:13:49.713 line:80%
[giggles]

00:13:52.716 --> 00:13:56.178 line:80%
I have to go study now,
so I'll see you later.

00:13:57.012 --> 00:13:58.097 line:80%
Song Hadam.

00:13:59.348 --> 00:14:01.558 line:80%
Hey. How…

00:14:01.642 --> 00:14:04.269 line:80%
Haran. Sis!

00:14:05.104 --> 00:14:08.232 line:80%
Shouldn't you say something
as the eldest sister?

00:14:08.315 --> 00:14:10.734 line:80%
Grandma said she'll discuss it
after meeting him.

00:14:11.235 --> 00:14:12.361 line:80%
Go get ready for work.

00:14:12.945 --> 00:14:13.946 line:80%
What?

00:14:15.280 --> 00:14:16.824 line:80%
How are they all so relaxed

00:14:16.907 --> 00:14:19.076 line:80%
when a teenager said
she's getting married?

00:14:20.411 --> 00:14:22.830 line:80%
Mom, Dad. Isn't this crazy?

00:14:34.425 --> 00:14:37.553 line:80%
[Chan] <i>Then, I'll make you want</i>
<i>to become my friend.</i>

00:14:37.636 --> 00:14:39.596 line:80%
[echoing] <i>I'll make you want</i>
<i>to become my friend.</i>

00:14:39.680 --> 00:14:41.348 line:80%
-[sighs]
-[♪ amusing music playing]

00:14:41.432 --> 00:14:43.309 line:80%
What is he trying to do?

00:14:46.812 --> 00:14:48.105 line:80%
Do you have a meeting here?

00:14:48.814 --> 00:14:51.483 line:80%
No, I just wanted to get everyone coffee.

00:14:51.567 --> 00:14:53.027 line:80%
Coffee? Nice!

00:14:53.110 --> 00:14:54.820 line:80%
I'll be back in a second.

00:14:58.282 --> 00:15:00.993 line:80%
Oh. Ms. Song, what are you doing?

00:15:01.660 --> 00:15:03.996 line:80%
[sighs] It's nothing.

00:15:09.668 --> 00:15:12.212 line:80%
-[♪ music fades]
-[Seung-gyu sighs] Mmm.

00:15:12.296 --> 00:15:13.339 line:80%
This is good.

00:15:14.715 --> 00:15:16.216 line:80%
[chuckles softly, inhales sharply]

00:15:17.343 --> 00:15:18.761 line:80%
Where's Ms. Song?

00:15:18.844 --> 00:15:21.055 line:80%
She disappears at 12 on the dot.

00:15:21.764 --> 00:15:24.642 line:80%
Is she Lunch Cinderella or what?
Where is she even going?

00:15:24.725 --> 00:15:26.894 line:80%
Does she think I'll get curious about her?

00:15:27.895 --> 00:15:30.105 line:80%
Since you're here, have lunch with us.

00:15:30.189 --> 00:15:31.690 line:80%
Sorry, I'll pass today.

00:15:31.774 --> 00:15:33.692 line:80%
Next time. Enjoy your lunch.

00:15:36.195 --> 00:15:37.363 line:80%
Genius.

00:15:37.446 --> 00:15:40.366 line:80%
-Are you visiting, too?
-[barks]

00:15:40.449 --> 00:15:41.533 line:80%
[Haran] Aww.

00:15:43.118 --> 00:15:45.079 line:80%
I can't go to SHIM for a while.

00:15:45.162 --> 00:15:46.705 line:80%
I'll see you later.

00:15:46.789 --> 00:15:47.790 line:80%
[Haran coos]

00:15:50.793 --> 00:15:53.879 line:80%
[barking]

00:15:54.546 --> 00:15:56.965 line:80%
-[♪ upbeat song playing on speakers]
-[coughs]

00:16:00.386 --> 00:16:02.012 line:80%
[sighs heavily]

00:16:02.096 --> 00:16:04.098 line:80%
[lively chatter]

00:16:07.810 --> 00:16:08.811 line:80%
[slurps]

00:16:10.270 --> 00:16:11.271 line:80%
Ugh...

00:16:11.772 --> 00:16:13.148 line:80%
[groans]

00:16:15.192 --> 00:16:16.527 line:80%
[sighs]

00:16:22.032 --> 00:16:23.200 line:80%
[sighs]

00:16:23.283 --> 00:16:24.284 line:80%
[gasps]

00:16:32.543 --> 00:16:34.962 line:80%
[gasps] No way.

00:16:35.045 --> 00:16:37.381 line:80%
[gasping]

00:16:38.382 --> 00:16:40.050 line:80%
-[both exclaim]
-[tableware clanging]

00:16:40.551 --> 00:16:41.927 line:80%
[Haran exclaims]

00:16:42.011 --> 00:16:43.095 line:80%
I'm sorry.

00:16:43.178 --> 00:16:46.765 line:80%
Are you okay?
I'll order the same one for you. [sighs]

00:16:48.017 --> 00:16:50.144 line:80%
[papers rustle]

00:16:50.227 --> 00:16:53.022 line:80%
Okay. Let's run the meeting
with Lafayette like this.

00:16:53.731 --> 00:16:55.357 line:80%
Is there anything else? If that's it…

00:16:55.441 --> 00:16:57.359 line:80%
I want to say something.

00:16:58.027 --> 00:16:59.236 line:80%
Go on.

00:17:00.404 --> 00:17:05.075 line:80%
I want to be excluded
from the animation collaboration.

00:17:05.159 --> 00:17:06.160 line:80%
[hiccups]

00:17:06.243 --> 00:17:08.787 line:80%
[♪ pensive music playing]

00:17:10.873 --> 00:17:11.957 line:80%
Why?

00:17:12.791 --> 00:17:16.503 line:80%
Well, I don't know much about animation,

00:17:16.587 --> 00:17:18.589 line:80%
and I don't think I'm skilled enough--

00:17:18.672 --> 00:17:19.715 line:80%
[Nana] Stop.

00:17:20.341 --> 00:17:21.592 line:80%
That's a long excuse.

00:17:23.135 --> 00:17:24.345 line:80%
Prove yourself instead.

00:17:24.428 --> 00:17:25.596 line:80%
Just do it, no matter what.

00:17:27.640 --> 00:17:28.641 line:80%
That's it for today.

00:17:30.100 --> 00:17:33.103 line:80%
[staff] Thank you.

00:17:36.649 --> 00:17:38.150 line:80%
[sighs]

00:17:41.904 --> 00:17:42.905 line:80%
[sighs]

00:17:44.198 --> 00:17:45.199 line:80%
[door closes]

00:17:47.576 --> 00:17:50.746 line:80%
-[♪ soft jazz music playing on speakers]
-[shop bell chimes]

00:17:51.664 --> 00:17:53.540 line:80%
Mr. Park. Oh…

00:17:54.875 --> 00:17:56.126 line:80%
Is she not here?

00:17:56.210 --> 00:17:58.212 line:80%
Do you need to see her?

00:17:58.295 --> 00:18:00.422 line:80%
[chuckles] It's nothing.
I'll head upstairs.

00:18:00.506 --> 00:18:01.799 line:80%
All right.

00:18:05.094 --> 00:18:06.095 line:80%
[Chan grunts]

00:18:07.054 --> 00:18:08.055 line:80%
[chuckles]

00:18:10.349 --> 00:18:11.433 line:80%
Ah.

00:18:11.517 --> 00:18:13.727 line:80%
-I'm heading out for a bit!
-Okay.

00:18:13.811 --> 00:18:15.437 line:80%
[♪ pleasant music playing]

00:18:15.521 --> 00:18:18.023 line:80%
-[shop bell chimes]
-He just got here. Where is he going?

00:18:18.107 --> 00:18:20.317 line:80%
-[shop bell chimes]
-[Chan] Mr. Park, I'm going upstairs!

00:18:22.111 --> 00:18:23.737 line:80%
Mr. Park, I'm heading out!

00:18:23.821 --> 00:18:25.823 line:80%
-Where are you going?
-Just buying something!

00:18:25.906 --> 00:18:28.158 line:80%
-Good boy. Wait.
-[Chan] I'm going upstairs!

00:18:28.242 --> 00:18:30.494 line:80%
-[objects clatter]
-[groaning]

00:18:30.577 --> 00:18:32.454 line:80%
-[Chan] Is it broken?
-Did you break something?

00:18:32.538 --> 00:18:35.833 line:80%
[panting] No, it's fine.
I'm going upstairs.

00:18:36.417 --> 00:18:38.168 line:80%
[scoffs, exclaims]

00:18:38.669 --> 00:18:42.715 line:80%
Genius, do you know why he's so busy?

00:18:43.257 --> 00:18:44.383 line:80%
[whines]

00:18:47.386 --> 00:18:48.387 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:18:48.470 --> 00:18:50.597 line:80%
[cell phone vibrating]

00:18:59.565 --> 00:19:02.484 line:80%
[telephone ringing]

00:19:06.238 --> 00:19:08.282 line:80%
-Yes, this is Nana Atelier--
-[woman gasping] <i>Help me.</i>

00:19:08.782 --> 00:19:10.117 line:80%
Hayeong?

00:19:10.200 --> 00:19:12.036 line:20%
[shop owner] It's 39,000 won.

00:19:16.248 --> 00:19:18.625 line:80%
[exclaims] I'll transfer the money.
It's fine.

00:19:18.709 --> 00:19:20.878 line:80%
It's okay. Eat as much as you want.

00:19:22.504 --> 00:19:23.505 line:80%
Here.

00:19:23.589 --> 00:19:24.715 line:80%
YUMMY SNACK BAR

00:19:24.798 --> 00:19:25.841 line:80%
[in English] Okay.

00:19:25.924 --> 00:19:27.384 line:80%
[in Korean] Then I'll treat you next time.

00:19:30.679 --> 00:19:32.514 line:80%
Here. Have one.

00:19:32.598 --> 00:19:35.059 line:80%
-It's fine--
-Come on. Try it.

00:19:35.142 --> 00:19:37.603 line:80%
I mean, no one carries around
cash these days.

00:19:37.686 --> 00:19:39.688 line:80%
I was about to transfer the money,

00:19:40.397 --> 00:19:44.360 line:80%
[mouthful] but I left my phone
at the office.

00:19:45.110 --> 00:19:47.821 line:80%
So I borrowed the owner's phone
and called,

00:19:47.905 --> 00:19:51.659 line:80%
hoping someone would pick up at work.

00:19:51.742 --> 00:19:54.453 line:80%
And, wow, the man
who always goes home last

00:19:54.536 --> 00:19:56.455 line:80%
picked up and saved me.

00:19:56.538 --> 00:19:58.791 line:80%
-Applause.
-[cell phone vibrating]

00:19:58.874 --> 00:20:00.000 line:80%
[Hayeong] Hang on.

00:20:01.835 --> 00:20:03.087 line:80%
Hey, Chaewon.

00:20:03.587 --> 00:20:04.588 line:80%
A blind date?

00:20:05.422 --> 00:20:07.174 line:80%
Okay, send me his profile.

00:20:08.008 --> 00:20:09.134 line:80%
Okay.

00:20:11.929 --> 00:20:13.013 line:80%
Someone saw my photo

00:20:13.097 --> 00:20:15.057 line:80%
and asked my friend
to set us up on a date.

00:20:15.140 --> 00:20:16.558 line:80%
He said I'm his type.

00:20:17.893 --> 00:20:18.978 line:80%
-[cell phone vibrates]
-[sighs]

00:20:19.061 --> 00:20:21.939 line:80%
I always end up just being friends
with guys on blind dates.

00:20:24.274 --> 00:20:27.611 line:80%
But this time, it might be different.

00:20:28.320 --> 00:20:29.363 line:80%
He's handsome, right?

00:20:29.905 --> 00:20:33.617 line:80%
[hums excitedly] "Cha Min."
Even his name is nice.

00:20:34.493 --> 00:20:35.911 line:80%
What do you think, Mr. Yeon?

00:20:37.663 --> 00:20:39.456 line:80%
I'm not so sure.

00:20:39.540 --> 00:20:41.583 line:80%
[mockingly] You're not so sure?

00:20:42.209 --> 00:20:43.877 line:80%
Mmm. He looks okay.

00:20:44.670 --> 00:20:47.006 line:80%
[Hayeong clears throat] Thank you.

00:20:47.965 --> 00:20:49.299 line:80%
Bye!

00:20:49.383 --> 00:20:51.552 line:80%
-[shop owner] Come again next time!
-[Hayeong] Okay.

00:20:51.635 --> 00:20:53.012 line:20%
Right, my phone!

00:20:56.140 --> 00:20:57.474 line:20%
Bye!

00:21:10.571 --> 00:21:12.698 line:80%
CHARACTER "WON"

00:21:15.868 --> 00:21:20.164 line:80%
I want to be excluded
from the animation collaboration.

00:21:21.415 --> 00:21:22.499 line:80%
[inhales deeply]

00:21:23.125 --> 00:21:24.752 line:80%
Did they argue?

00:21:27.338 --> 00:21:28.339 line:80%
Hang on.

00:21:29.590 --> 00:21:30.632 line:80%
No…

00:21:34.178 --> 00:21:36.847 line:80%
I'm going on a blind date.

00:21:37.640 --> 00:21:38.641 line:80%
Okay.

00:21:39.391 --> 00:21:41.727 line:80%
Were you two deceiving me?

00:21:41.810 --> 00:21:43.187 line:80%
What?

00:21:44.104 --> 00:21:46.982 line:80%
You're seeing someone,
but you're at home on a weekend?

00:21:47.650 --> 00:21:49.026 line:80%
[♪ amusing music playing]

00:21:49.109 --> 00:21:50.611 line:80%
You were lying to me, weren't you?

00:21:50.694 --> 00:21:52.154 line:80%
We weren't lying.

00:21:52.237 --> 00:21:54.782 line:80%
Didn't you say you were meeting him today?

00:21:54.865 --> 00:21:55.949 line:80%
What?

00:21:56.033 --> 00:22:00.162 line:80%
I… Gosh, it's time to go.
We can head out together. [chuckles]

00:22:01.538 --> 00:22:03.082 line:80%
See you later.

00:22:03.624 --> 00:22:04.625 line:80%
Bye!

00:22:07.878 --> 00:22:08.879 line:80%
[inhales sharply]

00:22:09.380 --> 00:22:11.173 line:80%
That's suspicious.

00:22:12.633 --> 00:22:13.926 line:80%
Is it really true?

00:22:17.388 --> 00:22:18.472 line:80%
[♪ music ends]

00:22:18.555 --> 00:22:20.808 line:80%
Hayeong, why do you keep doing this?

00:22:20.891 --> 00:22:23.727 line:80%
Shh! This is for your sake.

00:22:23.811 --> 00:22:26.146 line:80%
Mr. Yoon won't be
the only one on Grandma's list.

00:22:26.230 --> 00:22:28.023 line:80%
-Just spend some time outside.
-[sighs]

00:22:28.107 --> 00:22:30.025 line:80%
You can go to Genius' coffee shop.

00:22:30.109 --> 00:22:31.652 line:80%
I can't go there.

00:22:32.277 --> 00:22:34.238 line:80%
-Maybe I should go to the office.
-No.

00:22:34.321 --> 00:22:36.240 line:80%
Don't you know Grandma?

00:22:36.323 --> 00:22:38.409 line:80%
I bet she checks all the entrance records.

00:22:38.492 --> 00:22:39.493 line:80%
-[sighs]
-[cell phone vibrating]

00:22:39.576 --> 00:22:41.829 line:80%
[gasps] Hang in there, okay?

00:22:41.912 --> 00:22:43.247 line:80%
-Bye!
-[stutters]

00:22:43.330 --> 00:22:44.623 line:80%
Mr. Cha? Hi.

00:22:45.916 --> 00:22:47.626 line:80%
[sighs frustratingly] Darn it.

00:22:49.128 --> 00:22:50.504 line:80%
I have nowhere to go.

00:22:51.714 --> 00:22:53.716 line:80%
[♪ soft music playing on speakers]

00:22:55.009 --> 00:22:56.760 line:80%
[pager vibrates]

00:22:56.844 --> 00:22:58.595 line:80%
[customers chatter indistinctly]

00:22:58.679 --> 00:23:01.557 line:80%
[customer 1]
The course was so tough today.

00:23:02.141 --> 00:23:04.101 line:80%
[indistinct chatter continues]

00:23:04.184 --> 00:23:05.477 line:80%
[customer 1] Gosh.

00:23:07.062 --> 00:23:08.272 line:80%
[customer 2] There's a large variety.

00:23:08.939 --> 00:23:09.940 line:80%
[♪ whimsical music playing]

00:23:10.024 --> 00:23:13.360 line:80%
[Chan] <i>Then I'll make you want</i>
<i>to become my friend.</i>

00:23:13.444 --> 00:23:17.114 line:80%
[echoing] <i>I'll make you want</i>
<i>to become my friend.</i>

00:23:17.197 --> 00:23:18.574 line:80%
[customer 1] Geez.

00:23:19.616 --> 00:23:23.120 line:80%
[customer 3] You ran around a lot today,
so this is on me today.

00:23:23.203 --> 00:23:25.664 line:80%
-So have anything you want.
-[customers exclaim, applause]

00:23:25.748 --> 00:23:27.374 line:80%
[customer 4] I'm going to have
something expensive.

00:23:27.458 --> 00:23:28.667 line:80%
Who are you?

00:23:29.251 --> 00:23:30.794 line:80%
What? I…

00:23:31.211 --> 00:23:33.714 line:80%
Ah. [chuckles] I have a girlfriend.

00:23:35.299 --> 00:23:38.260 line:80%
No, it's not that.
Sorry. I'll just sit here for a second.

00:23:38.344 --> 00:23:40.596 line:80%
[customer 3] You were amazing, Mr. Seonu.

00:23:40.679 --> 00:23:42.264 line:80%
How were you so good on your first day?

00:23:42.348 --> 00:23:47.019 line:80%
I was just doing my best
not to fall behind. [chuckles]

00:23:47.102 --> 00:23:50.022 line:80%
Number 26, your order's ready.

00:23:50.105 --> 00:23:51.357 line:80%
[pager vibrates]

00:23:52.107 --> 00:23:53.776 line:80%
[stutters] You can have this.

00:23:53.859 --> 00:23:56.737 line:80%
[restaurant staff]
Number 26, your salad is ready.

00:23:56.820 --> 00:23:58.238 line:80%
Number 26?

00:23:59.573 --> 00:24:02.785 line:80%
Number 26, your order is ready.

00:24:02.868 --> 00:24:04.578 line:80%
Number 26?

00:24:12.753 --> 00:24:13.754 line:80%
[♪ music ends]

00:24:13.837 --> 00:24:15.839 line:80%
[scraping]

00:24:21.637 --> 00:24:22.846 line:80%
[sighs]

00:24:27.518 --> 00:24:29.144 line:80%
[gasps, sighs]

00:24:29.228 --> 00:24:30.771 line:80%
It's only 5:00 p.m.

00:24:30.854 --> 00:24:31.897 line:80%
Tsk.

00:24:32.898 --> 00:24:34.858 line:80%
-[sighs]
-[boy] You're good!

00:24:34.942 --> 00:24:36.568 line:80%
[children cheering]

00:24:36.652 --> 00:24:38.404 line:80%
You're so good!

00:24:38.487 --> 00:24:39.613 line:80%
-Right?
-[boy] You're amazing!

00:24:40.948 --> 00:24:44.034 line:80%
[Chan] <i>Then I'll make you want</i>
<i>to become my friend.</i>

00:24:44.118 --> 00:24:45.703 line:80%
[echoing] <i>I'll make you want</i>
<i>to become my friend.</i>

00:24:45.786 --> 00:24:48.080 line:80%
[♪ whimsical music playing]

00:24:48.163 --> 00:24:49.373 line:80%
[Haran] <i>What is he doing here?</i>

00:24:49.456 --> 00:24:50.666 line:80%
[boy 1] I want to do it, too.

00:24:50.749 --> 00:24:52.418 line:80%
-[boy 2] You're so good.
-[boy 3] I want to do it.

00:24:52.501 --> 00:24:54.545 line:80%
-I want to do it, too!
-[Chan exclaims]

00:24:58.507 --> 00:25:00.134 line:80%
-Oh no.
-Oh no.

00:25:00.217 --> 00:25:01.552 line:80%
I'm sorry!

00:25:05.514 --> 00:25:06.932 line:80%
Where do I go?

00:25:07.975 --> 00:25:08.976 line:80%
[Haran groans]

00:25:09.518 --> 00:25:10.519 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:25:11.270 --> 00:25:13.272 line:80%
[Chan sighs] Where did she go?

00:25:13.856 --> 00:25:14.982 line:80%
I'm sorry!

00:25:20.654 --> 00:25:22.656 line:80%
[♪ slow pensive music playing]

00:25:37.838 --> 00:25:38.839 line:80%
[sighs]

00:25:45.429 --> 00:25:46.805 line:80%
[dog barks]

00:25:47.723 --> 00:25:51.226 line:80%
[Chan] <i>Then, I'll make you want</i>
<i>to become my friend.</i>

00:25:51.310 --> 00:25:53.103 line:80%
[sighs defeatedly] Again?

00:25:57.191 --> 00:25:59.902 line:80%
Oh? Ms. Song! [chuckles]

00:26:03.864 --> 00:26:05.407 line:80%
It's nice being neighbors.

00:26:05.491 --> 00:26:08.369 line:80%
I was going to call you to give you this.

00:26:08.952 --> 00:26:10.621 line:80%
Aren't they pretty?

00:26:10.704 --> 00:26:12.998 line:80%
Green tangerine, lemon, beet…

00:26:13.082 --> 00:26:15.209 line:80%
They're good for…
Hey, you're not coughing.

00:26:15.292 --> 00:26:18.003 line:80%
-I'm sorry, but I have to go…
-[traffic light beeping]

00:26:18.754 --> 00:26:20.547 line:80%
I have to go. Sorry.

00:26:25.886 --> 00:26:27.721 line:80%
[engine accelerating]

00:26:28.639 --> 00:26:30.099 line:80%
-[exclaims]
-[glass shatters]

00:26:30.182 --> 00:26:32.601 line:80%
-[engine revs]
-[tires screech]

00:26:32.685 --> 00:26:33.686 line:80%
[Chan grunts]

00:26:33.811 --> 00:26:35.270 line:80%
[rider] Watch the traffic lights!

00:26:35.354 --> 00:26:36.647 line:80%
-[Chan grunts]
-[Haran sighs]

00:26:36.730 --> 00:26:37.731 line:80%
Are you okay?

00:26:38.565 --> 00:26:41.068 line:80%
Uh… Why were you in such a hurry?

00:26:41.652 --> 00:26:42.987 line:80%
-[Haran groans]
-[Chan exclaims]

00:26:43.070 --> 00:26:44.238 line:80%
Are you hurt?

00:26:44.321 --> 00:26:45.489 line:80%
Let me see.

00:26:47.741 --> 00:26:49.451 line:80%
[stammers] Wait.

00:26:52.079 --> 00:26:53.414 line:80%
[Chan grunts]

00:26:54.248 --> 00:26:55.249 line:80%
[Haran sighs]

00:26:56.000 --> 00:26:58.502 line:80%
[Chan pants] Sorry, sir.

00:26:59.336 --> 00:27:00.963 line:80%
-[Haran groans]
-[Chan pants]

00:27:01.046 --> 00:27:02.464 line:80%
We should go to a hospital.

00:27:02.548 --> 00:27:03.882 line:80%
It's fine.

00:27:04.550 --> 00:27:07.636 line:80%
No, it's not. You hurt your hand,
and you're a designer.

00:27:08.679 --> 00:27:09.680 line:80%
[Chan sighs]

00:27:10.889 --> 00:27:12.808 line:80%
I'm sorry. [grunts]

00:27:13.726 --> 00:27:15.853 line:80%
-Let's go get you treated.
-Why did you…

00:27:17.730 --> 00:27:18.731 line:80%
[sighs heavily]

00:27:19.356 --> 00:27:22.109 line:80%
I told you I have no intention
of getting close to you.

00:27:22.860 --> 00:27:27.156 line:80%
It makes me uncomfortable
when you act like we're close.

00:27:27.239 --> 00:27:31.869 line:80%
It may have sounded weird since I'm a guy,
but I didn't mean anything like that--

00:27:31.952 --> 00:27:34.788 line:80%
Whether you're a guy or not,
I don't want to get close.

00:27:34.872 --> 00:27:38.417 line:80%
I can't even go to the cafe
I love the most because of you, and…

00:27:39.168 --> 00:27:41.420 line:80%
-[♪ heartwarming music playing]
-[Haran sighs wearily]

00:27:41.503 --> 00:27:43.964 line:80%
I can't keep avoiding you
in the same neighborhood,

00:27:44.048 --> 00:27:45.549 line:80%
so let me be frank.

00:27:45.632 --> 00:27:47.217 line:80%
I'm really sorry,

00:27:48.594 --> 00:27:50.721 line:80%
but I'm a bit weird.

00:27:51.472 --> 00:27:54.058 line:80%
I feel at ease
only if nothing happens in my life.

00:27:54.892 --> 00:27:56.977 line:80%
I hate people entering my life,

00:27:57.061 --> 00:27:59.146 line:80%
and I hate my daily routine
getting disturbed.

00:27:59.229 --> 00:28:00.230 line:80%
I…

00:28:00.314 --> 00:28:02.858 line:80%
I don't need any variables in my life.

00:28:03.817 --> 00:28:04.902 line:80%
Please.

00:28:05.986 --> 00:28:07.029 line:80%
[sighs]

00:28:08.197 --> 00:28:09.198 line:80%
[mumbles]

00:28:12.159 --> 00:28:14.662 line:80%
I understand. I get it.

00:28:14.745 --> 00:28:17.915 line:80%
I'll just stand quietly next to you,

00:28:19.958 --> 00:28:21.251 line:80%
so let's go to the hospital.

00:28:22.836 --> 00:28:24.088 line:80%
Your wrist's swollen.

00:28:27.549 --> 00:28:28.926 line:80%
Please.

00:28:35.516 --> 00:28:37.351 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:28:38.686 --> 00:28:40.604 line:80%
[doctor] Uh… It's a Grade 1 sprain.

00:28:40.688 --> 00:28:43.107 line:80%
There's some irritation
to the soft tissue,

00:28:43.190 --> 00:28:46.276 line:80%
so try not to move your wrist too much
for the next two weeks.

00:28:47.361 --> 00:28:48.654 line:80%
The nurse will treat you.

00:28:48.737 --> 00:28:50.155 line:80%
All right. Thank you.

00:28:50.239 --> 00:28:51.991 line:80%
-Just a moment, please.
-Okay.

00:28:52.074 --> 00:28:53.117 line:80%
[Chan] Thank you.

00:28:57.788 --> 00:28:58.789 line:80%
[clears throat]

00:29:06.588 --> 00:29:08.882 line:80%
Come out when you're done.

00:29:08.966 --> 00:29:10.175 line:80%
I'll be waiting outside.

00:29:17.349 --> 00:29:20.936 line:80%
Do I have to keep this on?
My family's going to worry.

00:29:21.020 --> 00:29:24.023 line:80%
You can switch to a brace
and take it off from time to time.

00:29:24.106 --> 00:29:26.775 line:80%
Wearing it for too long
will slow down natural healing,

00:29:26.859 --> 00:29:30.154 line:80%
so check your condition for a few days
and take it off if there's no pain.

00:29:30.237 --> 00:29:31.405 line:80%
Okay.

00:29:47.796 --> 00:29:50.799 line:20%
[♪ soft emotional song playing]

00:29:53.260 --> 00:29:56.347 line:80%
[restaurant staff]
Number 26, your salad is ready.

00:29:56.430 --> 00:29:59.725 line:80%
I can't even go to the cafe
I love the most because of you, and…

00:30:00.309 --> 00:30:01.310 line:80%
[sighs wearily]

00:30:04.772 --> 00:30:06.607 line:80%
[sighs]

00:30:38.681 --> 00:30:40.099 line:80%
I'm sorry.

00:30:43.602 --> 00:30:46.897 line:80%
I didn't think what I said
bothered you that much.

00:30:48.190 --> 00:30:49.984 line:80%
If I was an uncomfortable variable,

00:30:51.527 --> 00:30:52.569 line:80%
I'm really sorry.

00:30:53.529 --> 00:30:54.530 line:80%
[Haran] Oh…

00:30:55.364 --> 00:30:58.158 line:80%
So just come to SHIM whenever you want.

00:30:58.742 --> 00:31:00.953 line:80%
It would be a shame
not to be able to go there.

00:31:01.537 --> 00:31:02.621 line:80%
I'll move out.

00:31:02.705 --> 00:31:04.915 line:80%
And walk around the neighborhood
as you want.

00:31:04.999 --> 00:31:08.127 line:80%
I'll leave so we won't
run into each other.

00:31:08.210 --> 00:31:09.628 line:80%
Just give me a few days.

00:31:09.712 --> 00:31:10.713 line:80%
And at work,

00:31:11.505 --> 00:31:13.507 line:80%
I'll pretend nothing happened.

00:31:14.591 --> 00:31:16.010 line:80%
I promise to never create

00:31:17.886 --> 00:31:19.179 line:80%
any variables for you…

00:31:21.765 --> 00:31:23.726 line:80%
or bother you again.

00:31:25.311 --> 00:31:27.187 line:80%
-[sighs] I…
-[taxi honks]

00:31:28.439 --> 00:31:31.483 line:80%
Oh. Sorry, sir. She's getting in.

00:31:34.611 --> 00:31:35.612 line:80%
Go on.

00:31:35.696 --> 00:31:37.698 line:80%
[♪ soft emotional song playing]

00:31:56.925 --> 00:31:58.052 line:80%
[sighs]

00:32:06.644 --> 00:32:08.062 line:80%
[sighs]

00:32:08.145 --> 00:32:09.980 line:80%
[♪ song fades]

00:32:11.940 --> 00:32:12.941 line:80%
[cell phone vibrating]

00:32:13.025 --> 00:32:15.152 line:80%
SHIM

00:32:15.986 --> 00:32:16.987 line:80%
Hmm?

00:32:20.991 --> 00:32:22.951 line:80%
Mr. Park, hi.

00:32:23.035 --> 00:32:24.036 line:80%
Hey there.

00:32:24.662 --> 00:32:26.413 line:80%
Sorry for calling you.

00:32:26.497 --> 00:32:29.208 line:80%
You've been coming here every day
for seven years,

00:32:29.291 --> 00:32:31.960 line:80%
so I've been worried
since you haven't come in a while.

00:32:32.044 --> 00:32:33.504 line:80%
Are you sick or anything?

00:32:33.587 --> 00:32:35.422 line:80%
I'm just busy with work.

00:32:35.923 --> 00:32:37.633 line:80%
I'll be back once it's settled.

00:32:38.801 --> 00:32:39.885 line:80%
Yes.

00:32:40.886 --> 00:32:42.012 line:80%
[Chan] <i>I'm here!</i>

00:32:42.096 --> 00:32:43.222 line:80%
[Manjae] <i>You're late.</i>

00:32:43.305 --> 00:32:44.515 line:80%
[Chan] <i>You had dinner, right?</i>

00:32:44.598 --> 00:32:47.434 line:80%
[Manjae] <i>Of course.</i>
<i>I enjoyed the stew you cooked for me.</i>

00:32:47.518 --> 00:32:50.229 line:80%
<i>How are you such a good cook?</i>

00:32:51.146 --> 00:32:52.773 line:80%
-[Chan] <i>What about your medicine?</i>
-[line disconnects]

00:32:56.819 --> 00:32:58.237 line:80%
[♪ solemn music playing]

00:32:58.320 --> 00:33:00.948 line:80%
I thought I'd feel safer
if there was someone with me.

00:33:01.031 --> 00:33:03.867 line:80%
And he's adorable.

00:33:03.951 --> 00:33:06.161 line:80%
He's a really good man.

00:33:06.245 --> 00:33:07.913 line:80%
I'll move out.

00:33:08.706 --> 00:33:09.915 line:80%
[sighs heavily]

00:33:13.836 --> 00:33:15.087 line:80%
[sighs]

00:33:17.089 --> 00:33:19.133 line:80%
Of course, I took my medicine.

00:33:19.216 --> 00:33:22.594 line:80%
I get a harsh scolding
from someone named Chan

00:33:22.678 --> 00:33:24.888 line:80%
if I don't take them.

00:33:24.972 --> 00:33:26.473 line:80%
[both chuckle]

00:33:28.058 --> 00:33:29.059 line:80%
Oh?

00:33:30.811 --> 00:33:33.522 line:80%
This guy must be
going through a transplant shock.

00:33:34.523 --> 00:33:36.025 line:80%
A transplant shock?

00:33:36.108 --> 00:33:39.028 line:80%
When plants are suddenly
put in a different environment…

00:33:39.111 --> 00:33:42.906 line:80%
[inhales sharply] they go into shock,
thinking, "Where am I"?

00:33:42.990 --> 00:33:43.991 line:80%
Just like humans.

00:33:44.992 --> 00:33:49.663 line:80%
They need time to adjust
to an unexpected variable.

00:33:50.247 --> 00:33:51.749 line:80%
A variable…

00:33:53.125 --> 00:33:57.546 line:80%
What if… they can't adjust?

00:33:58.422 --> 00:34:00.883 line:80%
A lot of them just wither

00:34:01.800 --> 00:34:03.344 line:80%
and die in the end.

00:34:04.595 --> 00:34:07.514 line:80%
[clicks tongue] It's a pity.

00:34:09.808 --> 00:34:12.311 line:80%
-[♪ music ends]
-I should clean up.

00:34:12.978 --> 00:34:15.064 line:80%
-Wait, I'll do it.
-[exclaims]

00:34:15.147 --> 00:34:19.318 line:80%
I said I'd kick you out if you do this.
It's my job to do that.

00:34:19.401 --> 00:34:23.405 line:80%
I love cleaning windows.
It's a habit of mine.

00:34:24.156 --> 00:34:25.324 line:80%
My gosh.

00:34:28.869 --> 00:34:30.079 line:80%
All right…

00:34:31.914 --> 00:34:33.624 line:80%
[mirror squeaking]

00:34:34.333 --> 00:34:35.334 line:80%
[sighs]

00:34:35.417 --> 00:34:38.545 line:80%
[Haran] <i>I can't even go to the cafe</i>
<i>I love the most because of you, and…</i>

00:34:38.629 --> 00:34:41.298 line:80%
[Chan] <i>Come to SHIM whenever you want.</i>
<i>I'll move out.</i>

00:34:41.924 --> 00:34:43.133 line:80%
Mr. Park.

00:34:43.217 --> 00:34:45.511 line:80%
How can you be so adorable?

00:34:45.594 --> 00:34:49.598 line:80%
I feel like I've suddenly gotten a son.

00:34:51.183 --> 00:34:53.227 line:80%
Thank you for being here.

00:34:54.061 --> 00:34:55.270 line:80%
[chuckles]

00:34:56.480 --> 00:34:57.481 line:80%
[chuckles softly]

00:34:58.107 --> 00:34:59.274 line:80%
Oh, right.

00:35:00.734 --> 00:35:04.238 line:80%
Weren't you about to say something to me?

00:35:05.239 --> 00:35:06.240 line:80%
I…

00:35:07.700 --> 00:35:12.287 line:80%
I'll clean up here,
so you can go to bed. [chuckles softly]

00:35:13.414 --> 00:35:14.456 line:80%
All right.

00:35:15.708 --> 00:35:16.709 line:80%
And…

00:35:18.669 --> 00:35:19.920 line:80%
sleep tight.

00:35:20.004 --> 00:35:22.006 line:80%
[both chuckle]

00:35:22.089 --> 00:35:23.173 line:80%
Okay.

00:35:23.257 --> 00:35:24.675 line:80%
-Good night.
-Good night.

00:35:24.758 --> 00:35:25.884 line:80%
Oh, my.

00:35:27.594 --> 00:35:29.847 line:80%
Tsk. [sighs]

00:35:30.764 --> 00:35:32.766 line:80%
-[♪ heartwarming music playing]
-Tsk.

00:35:33.267 --> 00:35:38.188 line:80%
cafe SHIM

00:35:43.402 --> 00:35:44.403 line:80%
Tsk.

00:35:45.237 --> 00:35:46.405 line:80%
[sighs]

00:35:54.580 --> 00:35:57.124 line:80%
I should have just left her be.

00:35:58.250 --> 00:35:59.626 line:80%
It wasn't my business.

00:36:02.963 --> 00:36:04.715 line:80%
[crickets chirping]

00:36:04.798 --> 00:36:05.799 line:80%
[sighs]

00:36:07.593 --> 00:36:08.594 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:36:08.677 --> 00:36:09.887 line:80%
[captain] Good work, everyone.

00:36:09.970 --> 00:36:11.430 line:80%
Go, Cheongsol!

00:36:11.513 --> 00:36:13.349 line:80%
[all players] Go, Cheongsol!

00:36:13.432 --> 00:36:15.184 line:80%
-[player 1] Great work.
-[player 2] Great job.

00:36:15.267 --> 00:36:16.477 line:80%
[player 3] Great job, everyone.

00:36:16.560 --> 00:36:18.646 line:80%
[♪ upbeat rock music playing]

00:36:18.729 --> 00:36:20.272 line:80%
Why are you taking off your pants?

00:36:20.356 --> 00:36:21.732 line:80%
Take my uniform.

00:36:23.942 --> 00:36:26.028 line:80%
[Changmo] Cha Yougyum!
Where are you going?

00:36:26.111 --> 00:36:27.905 line:80%
I'm going to see Hadam!

00:36:30.074 --> 00:36:31.075 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:36:31.617 --> 00:36:32.785 line:80%
[cell phone chimes]

00:36:32.868 --> 00:36:33.869 line:80%
[cell phone vibrating]

00:36:33.952 --> 00:36:36.163 line:80%
Hey, Hadam.
I'll be there in three minutes.

00:36:36.246 --> 00:36:38.374 line:80%
-[signal light beeping]
-It's a green light!

00:36:39.249 --> 00:36:42.002 line:80%
-Don't run. I'm still on my way.
-[Yougyum sighs]

00:36:42.086 --> 00:36:45.172 line:80%
LAUNDRY DETERGENT, WHITE MUSK

00:36:45.255 --> 00:36:47.383 line:80%
-[car honking]
-[Yougyum exclaiming]

00:36:47.466 --> 00:36:49.051 line:80%
-[♪ tense music playing]
-What is it? Yougyum.

00:36:49.134 --> 00:36:50.803 line:80%
-[exclaiming]
-[engine revving]

00:36:50.886 --> 00:36:52.012 line:80%
-[tires screech]
-[phone clatters]

00:36:52.096 --> 00:36:53.263 line:80%
-[line disconnects]
-Cha Yougyum!

00:36:54.807 --> 00:36:55.933 line:80%
[gasps shakily]

00:36:57.309 --> 00:36:58.936 line:80%
[breathing shakily]

00:37:00.145 --> 00:37:02.856 line:80%
-[♪ music continues]
-[line ringing]

00:37:04.984 --> 00:37:06.986 line:80%
[whimpering]

00:37:08.654 --> 00:37:10.906 line:80%
-[Yougyum] Hadam!
-[gasps]

00:37:10.990 --> 00:37:12.074 line:80%
Song Hadam!

00:37:13.075 --> 00:37:14.994 line:80%
-[sighing in relief]
-[♪ music ends]

00:37:16.495 --> 00:37:18.122 line:80%
-[exclaiming]
-[crying]

00:37:20.374 --> 00:37:22.418 line:80%
-What's wrong, Hadam?
-[whimpering]

00:37:22.501 --> 00:37:26.005 line:80%
I heard a thud over the phone…

00:37:26.088 --> 00:37:29.675 line:80%
Oh… Sorry. Someone was in danger,
so I had to help them.

00:37:31.093 --> 00:37:32.344 line:80%
[Yougyum sighs]

00:37:32.428 --> 00:37:34.263 line:80%
It's fine if you're okay.

00:37:35.014 --> 00:37:36.682 line:80%
Is that person okay?

00:37:36.765 --> 00:37:38.183 line:80%
Yes, thankfully.

00:37:38.767 --> 00:37:41.437 line:80%
I promise not to worry you again.
I'm really sorry.

00:37:42.062 --> 00:37:43.981 line:80%
You must have been angry.

00:37:44.064 --> 00:37:46.608 line:80%
No, I like you even more now.

00:37:47.735 --> 00:37:49.528 line:80%
-You're so kind.
-[chuckles]

00:37:49.611 --> 00:37:51.363 line:80%
Grandma told me to bring you home.

00:37:51.447 --> 00:37:52.781 line:80%
Hmm?

00:37:52.865 --> 00:37:54.908 line:80%
[♪ whimsical music playing]

00:37:54.992 --> 00:37:57.119 line:80%
My heart's going to explode already.

00:37:57.202 --> 00:37:59.872 line:80%
[stutters] What do I wear? A suit?
Our school uniform?

00:37:59.955 --> 00:38:02.041 line:80%
Not my baseball uniform.
Should I do my hair?

00:38:02.124 --> 00:38:04.126 line:80%
I should get new socks, and…

00:38:04.209 --> 00:38:06.670 line:80%
First, let's eat something.

00:38:06.754 --> 00:38:09.506 line:80%
[whines] I'm hungry
after all that running.

00:38:09.590 --> 00:38:11.258 line:80%
-Okay.
-[Hadam chuckles softly]

00:38:15.763 --> 00:38:16.764 line:80%
Ah.

00:38:17.348 --> 00:38:20.559 line:80%
But do you really think
we can get married before I go?

00:38:21.352 --> 00:38:25.022 line:80%
Yougyum, did you ever see me
failing to carry out a plan?

00:38:25.731 --> 00:38:27.816 line:80%
-No.
-We just have to stick to my plan.

00:38:29.610 --> 00:38:30.653 line:80%
You're so cool.

00:38:30.736 --> 00:38:32.154 line:80%
[both chuckle]

00:38:33.489 --> 00:38:35.240 line:80%
[Hadam] The game was tough, wasn't it?

00:38:35.324 --> 00:38:37.242 line:80%
[Yougyum] It wasn't that tough,

00:38:37.326 --> 00:38:40.079 line:80%
but I feel like I aged 10 years
from missing you so much.

00:38:40.162 --> 00:38:42.164 line:80%
[Hadam] I aged 20 years.

00:38:42.956 --> 00:38:43.957 line:80%
[♪ music ends]

00:38:48.754 --> 00:38:50.297 line:80%
[Chan] Here. Hang on.

00:38:51.882 --> 00:38:52.925 line:80%
Wait.

00:38:53.008 --> 00:38:54.009 line:80%
[Chan clears throat]

00:38:56.512 --> 00:39:00.391 line:80%
Now, this drawing…
will turn into real candy.

00:39:01.392 --> 00:39:02.643 line:80%
[♪ amusing music playing]

00:39:02.726 --> 00:39:05.688 line:80%
-No way.
-That's nonsense.

00:39:05.771 --> 00:39:06.981 line:80%
I mean it.

00:39:07.064 --> 00:39:08.691 line:80%
All right… Mmm.

00:39:12.736 --> 00:39:14.071 line:80%
[rustling]

00:39:14.154 --> 00:39:15.698 line:80%
-Look.
-[all gasp]

00:39:15.781 --> 00:39:18.283 line:80%
-Where did they come from?
-What was that?

00:39:18.367 --> 00:39:20.119 line:80%
[staff] They're real.

00:39:20.202 --> 00:39:21.412 line:80%
[Sol] They're real candy.

00:39:21.495 --> 00:39:23.163 line:80%
Take them. Take them.

00:39:23.247 --> 00:39:24.748 line:80%
[staff exclaiming]

00:39:26.750 --> 00:39:27.960 line:80%
These actually are real.

00:39:28.043 --> 00:39:29.712 line:80%
-[Sol] How did you do that?
-[in English] Unbelievable.

00:39:29.837 --> 00:39:30.838 line:80%
Hi.

00:39:33.716 --> 00:39:35.009 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:39:35.092 --> 00:39:36.844 line:80%
[in Korean]
This is some kind of trick, right?

00:39:36.927 --> 00:39:39.930 line:80%
Chan, tell me how you did it.
I want to show my friends.

00:39:40.014 --> 00:39:41.348 line:80%
-[Chan] Okay.
-"Chan"?

00:39:41.432 --> 00:39:43.100 line:80%
I'll send a video to our group chat.

00:39:43.183 --> 00:39:44.935 line:80%
[staff] Yes!

00:39:45.019 --> 00:39:47.062 line:80%
Right, Chan. We need a revenge match.

00:39:47.146 --> 00:39:48.856 line:80%
-"Group chat"?
-[Seung-gyu] Let's go bowling again.

00:39:48.939 --> 00:39:50.441 line:80%
Sure. Anytime.

00:39:50.524 --> 00:39:52.609 line:80%
-I want to join, too!
-Me too. Me too.

00:39:53.110 --> 00:39:55.529 line:80%
[lively chatter, laughter]

00:39:55.612 --> 00:39:57.489 line:80%
-[Chan] Are you sure?
-[Sol] This will be fun.

00:39:57.573 --> 00:39:59.158 line:80%
[Seung-gyu] How will we divide teams?

00:39:59.241 --> 00:40:00.743 line:80%
-[Sol] Our teams?
-[Remy] Well…

00:40:00.826 --> 00:40:01.952 line:80%
♪ <i>Flip your hands </i>♪

00:40:02.036 --> 00:40:04.079 line:80%
-[Sol] What?
-[Hayeong] What is that?

00:40:04.163 --> 00:40:07.166 line:80%
Let's be friends while I'm in Korea.
Can I be really nice to you?

00:40:07.249 --> 00:40:09.001 line:80%
Sure. Of course.

00:40:09.084 --> 00:40:10.294 line:80%
Of course.

00:40:10.377 --> 00:40:13.005 line:80%
I really wanted to get close to you.

00:40:13.088 --> 00:40:15.090 line:80%
-Sure.
-Yes, sure. I'd love that.

00:40:16.592 --> 00:40:19.303 line:80%
No, you can't.

00:40:19.386 --> 00:40:21.639 line:80%
Whether it's a guy or not,

00:40:21.722 --> 00:40:24.141 line:80%
I have no intention
of getting close to anyone.

00:40:25.643 --> 00:40:27.728 line:80%
[staff] Rock, paper…

00:40:27.811 --> 00:40:28.979 line:80%
[Sol] Okay, rock.

00:40:29.063 --> 00:40:30.147 line:80%
-One, two, three.
-[staff] Okay!

00:40:30.230 --> 00:40:32.608 line:80%
[staff exclaiming, chattering]

00:40:32.691 --> 00:40:34.318 line:80%
-[man] This is a revenge match.
-[Hayeong] We won.

00:40:34.401 --> 00:40:36.403 line:80%
[staff cheering, laughing]

00:40:45.412 --> 00:40:51.168 line:80%
[Haran] <i>Did I overreact</i>
<i>when he asked everyone to be friends?</i>

00:40:56.799 --> 00:41:00.844 line:80%
Then let's select some
<i>dancheong </i>references that will suit Won

00:41:00.928 --> 00:41:02.930 line:80%
and put together a few rough drafts.

00:41:03.472 --> 00:41:04.473 line:80%
Sure.

00:41:04.556 --> 00:41:07.267 line:80%
I'm visiting some palaces
for some research tomorrow.

00:41:07.351 --> 00:41:08.686 line:80%
I'll take a lot of photos.

00:41:08.769 --> 00:41:10.354 line:80%
-Really?
-Yes.

00:41:12.022 --> 00:41:13.482 line:80%
You're going too, right?

00:41:14.566 --> 00:41:16.527 line:80%
-Me?
-Yes, you.

00:41:16.610 --> 00:41:19.321 line:80%
Shouldn't you do something
to show me results?

00:41:19.405 --> 00:41:22.157 line:80%
Well, I have a fabric meeting tomorrow,

00:41:22.241 --> 00:41:24.201 line:80%
-and I have to go to the factory--
-Send Raemee.

00:41:26.286 --> 00:41:27.746 line:80%
Go with him. It's for work.

00:41:29.164 --> 00:41:31.667 line:80%
You can bring Ms. Song with you, right?

00:41:31.750 --> 00:41:33.460 line:80%
Well… [chuckles nervously]

00:41:34.044 --> 00:41:37.881 line:80%
Then can I go to the palaces instead?
Ms. Song can go to the factory…

00:41:37.965 --> 00:41:40.134 line:80%
-[blade swishes]
-[lion roars]

00:41:40.217 --> 00:41:41.385 line:80%
[dog whimpers]

00:41:41.468 --> 00:41:43.887 line:80%
I would love to go to the factory.

00:41:43.971 --> 00:41:47.558 line:80%
I'll go there, and Ms. Song can go
to the palaces. [chuckles nervously]

00:41:48.100 --> 00:41:51.228 line:80%
Okay. Then let's gather
at our next meeting.

00:41:52.396 --> 00:41:55.649 line:80%
Ms. Kim, when should I go
to the factory tomorrow?

00:41:59.320 --> 00:42:01.530 line:80%
If you feel uneasy,
I'll go on a different date.

00:42:01.613 --> 00:42:02.656 line:80%
You can tell Ms. Kim--

00:42:02.740 --> 00:42:05.784 line:80%
No, let's go. It's for work.

00:42:08.954 --> 00:42:10.622 line:80%
Right. It's for work.

00:42:11.373 --> 00:42:13.083 line:80%
Then I'll text you the details.

00:42:14.043 --> 00:42:17.254 line:80%
And I'm sorry,
but give me some time to move out.

00:42:17.338 --> 00:42:19.089 line:80%
I haven't told Mr. Park yet.

00:42:20.007 --> 00:42:21.467 line:80%
Then I'll see you tomorrow.

00:42:21.550 --> 00:42:22.801 line:80%
[stammers] I…

00:42:26.889 --> 00:42:28.599 line:80%
[sighs, mumbles]

00:42:35.439 --> 00:42:38.484 line:80%
Yes. I'm heading to the Lafayette meeting.

00:42:38.567 --> 00:42:40.069 line:80%
I'll call you after.

00:42:40.152 --> 00:42:42.529 line:80%
-[Sol] Oh, gosh!
-[Remy] What? What is it?

00:42:42.613 --> 00:42:43.614 line:80%
[Sol] Oh, my gosh!

00:42:43.697 --> 00:42:45.783 line:80%
-[Remy] What is it?
-[Seungkyu] What's with those flowers?

00:42:45.866 --> 00:42:47.034 line:80%
-I received them.
-[Sol gasps]

00:42:47.117 --> 00:42:48.118 line:80%
[Sol] What?

00:42:48.202 --> 00:42:51.288 line:80%
Your date treated you to lunch
and gave you flowers?

00:42:51.372 --> 00:42:54.166 line:80%
Hang on, aren't these ranunculus flowers?

00:42:54.249 --> 00:42:56.502 line:80%
They mean "You're beautiful."

00:42:56.585 --> 00:42:59.046 line:80%
[sighs] Am I beautiful?

00:42:59.129 --> 00:43:01.548 line:80%
-[squealing]
-Geez. What's with you?

00:43:01.632 --> 00:43:03.342 line:80%
Are you dating? It doesn't suit you.

00:43:03.425 --> 00:43:06.261 line:80%
Not yet, but we'll meet often.
His workplace is nearby.

00:43:06.887 --> 00:43:09.848 line:80%
So I won't be able to have lunch
with you guys for a while.

00:43:09.932 --> 00:43:10.933 line:80%
[all exclaim]

00:43:11.016 --> 00:43:12.977 line:80%
-[Sol] I'm so jealous.
-[Seungkyu] Congratulations!

00:43:13.811 --> 00:43:15.562 line:80%
-[Sol] When are you meeting again?
-[Hayeong] Tomorrow.

00:43:15.646 --> 00:43:16.647 line:80%
[Sol and Remy squeal]

00:43:16.730 --> 00:43:18.941 line:80%
-[Remy] No way.
-[Sol] I'm so jealous.

00:43:20.484 --> 00:43:21.986 line:80%
[in English] Just to confirm,

00:43:22.069 --> 00:43:26.156 line:80%
do you want to tweak the details
on the Lafayette coat line one more time?

00:43:26.240 --> 00:43:30.035 line:80%
Yes. If you don't mind, we'd appreciate
pushing the delivery back a bit.

00:43:30.911 --> 00:43:32.204 line:80%
[woman 1 in Korean] I got a boyfriend.

00:43:32.287 --> 00:43:33.622 line:80%
-What do you think?
-Let me see.

00:43:33.706 --> 00:43:35.374 line:80%
-He's so handsome.
-Isn't he?

00:43:35.457 --> 00:43:37.292 line:80%
-What does he do?
-[woman 2] Let me see. Oh, my gosh.

00:43:37.376 --> 00:43:38.836 line:80%
[squeals]

00:43:38.919 --> 00:43:39.962 line:80%
Hello.

00:43:40.629 --> 00:43:44.550 line:80%
Do you know the meaning
of these ranunculus flowers?

00:43:44.633 --> 00:43:46.051 line:80%
[women] I don't know.

00:43:46.135 --> 00:43:47.553 line:80%
-"You're beautiful."
-[gasps, squeals]

00:43:47.636 --> 00:43:48.679 line:80%
What?

00:43:48.762 --> 00:43:49.763 line:80%
Thank you.

00:43:49.847 --> 00:43:50.848 line:80%
-[women squeal]
-[man chuckles]

00:43:50.931 --> 00:43:53.309 line:80%
[woman 1]
You said you couldn't come today.

00:43:54.476 --> 00:43:55.477 line:80%
[clicks tongue]

00:43:55.561 --> 00:43:57.730 line:80%
[in English] Surprise.

00:43:58.230 --> 00:43:59.732 line:80%
[man chuckles]

00:43:59.815 --> 00:44:03.402 line:80%
He's handsome, right?
"Cha Min." Even his name is nice.

00:44:04.695 --> 00:44:06.405 line:80%
I got these for you.

00:44:06.488 --> 00:44:08.490 line:80%
-What?
-Did you eat?

00:44:09.825 --> 00:44:12.870 line:80%
[in English] Mr. Yeon,
would one more week be okay with you?

00:44:12.953 --> 00:44:15.372 line:80%
Oh, yes.

00:44:17.082 --> 00:44:18.459 line:80%
[man in Korean]
Would you like some coffee?

00:44:18.542 --> 00:44:20.169 line:80%
[women squeal]

00:44:20.836 --> 00:44:22.463 line:80%
-[woman 2] Thank you. [squeals]
-[sighs]

00:44:24.131 --> 00:44:26.550 line:80%
[man 1] Hey, you look nice.

00:44:27.801 --> 00:44:29.678 line:80%
[woman] It's been a while
since I wore a <i>hanbok.</i>

00:44:29.762 --> 00:44:30.763 line:80%
SINGPUNGNU

00:44:30.846 --> 00:44:32.097 line:80%
[man 2] Wow, it's so cool.

00:44:34.308 --> 00:44:36.644 line:80%
[sighs] This is going to be awkward.

00:44:40.272 --> 00:44:43.275 line:80%
[♪ Korean traditional
instrumental music playing]

00:44:47.821 --> 00:44:49.490 line:80%
You've got to be kidding me.

00:44:53.619 --> 00:44:55.079 line:80%
You're here.

00:44:56.372 --> 00:44:58.165 line:80%
Your outfit…

00:44:59.124 --> 00:45:01.293 line:80%
Ah. The fee is free if we wear a <i>hanbok.</i>

00:45:01.377 --> 00:45:03.337 line:80%
If you want,
there's a rental shop over there…

00:45:03.420 --> 00:45:05.297 line:80%
No, it's completely fine.

00:45:06.131 --> 00:45:07.132 line:80%
-All right.
-[♪ music ends]

00:45:07.883 --> 00:45:09.510 line:80%
-Let's go, then.
-Okay.

00:45:11.053 --> 00:45:13.055 line:80%
[♪ pleasant music playing]

00:45:20.562 --> 00:45:21.772 line:80%
[camera shutter clicks]

00:45:23.899 --> 00:45:25.150 line:80%
[camera shutter clicks]

00:45:37.329 --> 00:45:39.373 line:80%
[camera shutter clicking]

00:45:41.333 --> 00:45:43.335 line:80%
Wow. Aren't they beautiful?

00:45:44.545 --> 00:45:45.963 line:80%
Thanks to the <i>dancheong,</i>

00:45:46.046 --> 00:45:48.882 line:80%
the wood doesn't rot in the rain
and is protected from pests.

00:45:50.384 --> 00:45:51.427 line:80%
Isn't it awesome?

00:45:52.136 --> 00:45:53.137 line:80%
[Chan] Mmm.

00:45:53.721 --> 00:45:55.139 line:80%
It's just basic knowledge.

00:45:55.764 --> 00:45:58.600 line:80%
I'd like to brag,
but I studied that in advance.

00:45:58.684 --> 00:46:00.477 line:80%
I like showing off my knowledge.

00:46:03.063 --> 00:46:04.064 line:80%
[clears throat]

00:46:05.607 --> 00:46:07.526 line:80%
This is my bucket list for Korea.

00:46:07.609 --> 00:46:09.903 line:80%
-I'd feel upset if I didn't do all these.
-[♪ music fades]

00:46:11.363 --> 00:46:15.242 line:80%
I don't know whether I'll be back
in a decade or two,

00:46:15.326 --> 00:46:19.163 line:80%
or maybe never again.

00:46:21.707 --> 00:46:24.793 line:80%
[in English] Wow, <i>hanbok </i>looks so cool.
Can I take a picture?

00:46:24.877 --> 00:46:26.170 line:80%
Of course, why not?

00:46:26.253 --> 00:46:27.421 line:80%
Okay. Guys, come on.

00:46:28.797 --> 00:46:30.132 line:80%
-Okay.
-Kimchi.

00:46:30.215 --> 00:46:31.467 line:80%
[tourists] Kimchi.

00:46:31.967 --> 00:46:33.344 line:80%
-Thank you.
-Thank you so much.

00:46:33.427 --> 00:46:34.636 line:80%
Have a great day.

00:46:35.471 --> 00:46:36.889 line:80%
Wow, man, it looks good.

00:46:36.972 --> 00:46:39.433 line:80%
[in Japanese]
Can we take a photo with you, too?

00:46:40.017 --> 00:46:41.185 line:80%
One, two, three.

00:46:41.769 --> 00:46:43.562 line:80%
[tourists and Chan] Thank you.

00:46:43.646 --> 00:46:45.481 line:80%
-[in English] Thank you.
-Thank you. Thank you so much.

00:46:45.564 --> 00:46:46.982 line:80%
-[woman 1] Have a nice day.
-You too.

00:46:47.066 --> 00:46:48.067 line:80%
[woman 2] Bye.

00:46:48.859 --> 00:46:51.195 line:80%
[in Korean] Ah, sorry,
I wore this to break the ice,

00:46:51.278 --> 00:46:52.863 line:80%
but I didn't expect this.

00:46:53.656 --> 00:46:56.033 line:80%
My clothes are in the locker,
so I'll get changed.

00:46:58.702 --> 00:46:59.995 line:80%
[student] It's the king!

00:47:00.079 --> 00:47:02.539 line:80%
-[Chan clears throat]
-[students chatter indistinctly]

00:47:02.623 --> 00:47:04.249 line:80%
Ice breaking…

00:47:12.966 --> 00:47:14.051 line:80%
[exhales]

00:47:16.095 --> 00:47:17.137 line:80%
[woman] Ran!

00:47:26.480 --> 00:47:27.481 line:80%
[Chan] Huh?

00:47:27.564 --> 00:47:31.276 line:20%
BONGSUDANG

00:47:32.403 --> 00:47:33.404 line:80%
Hmm?

00:47:35.406 --> 00:47:36.407 line:80%
Where did she go?

00:47:37.491 --> 00:47:38.742 line:80%
Did she go to the restroom?

00:47:43.706 --> 00:47:45.040 line:80%
[sighs heavily]

00:47:45.708 --> 00:47:46.709 line:80%
[sighs]

00:47:53.841 --> 00:47:54.842 line:80%
[sighs softly]

00:47:56.760 --> 00:47:59.471 line:80%
-[call connects]
-[cell phone ringing]

00:48:00.222 --> 00:48:01.265 line:80%
[Chan] Huh?

00:48:01.807 --> 00:48:04.101 line:80%
She left her phone here?

00:48:06.061 --> 00:48:08.063 line:80%
[ringing continues]

00:48:10.107 --> 00:48:11.775 line:80%
[♪ pensive music playing]

00:48:22.077 --> 00:48:23.954 line:80%
[Chan panting]

00:48:27.541 --> 00:48:30.377 line:80%
[panting]

00:48:31.837 --> 00:48:33.547 line:80%
Where in the world is she?

00:48:33.630 --> 00:48:35.632 line:80%
[continues panting]

00:48:46.769 --> 00:48:47.770 line:80%
What…

00:48:47.853 --> 00:48:49.146 line:80%
[pants]

00:48:49.229 --> 00:48:50.397 line:80%
Ms. Song!

00:48:53.400 --> 00:48:55.152 line:80%
[sighs, sniffles]

00:48:55.903 --> 00:48:57.821 line:80%
[Chan panting]

00:48:58.322 --> 00:48:59.907 line:80%
You just disappeared.

00:48:59.990 --> 00:49:01.283 line:80%
What is it?

00:49:01.367 --> 00:49:02.785 line:80%
Let's go. We have to work.

00:49:02.868 --> 00:49:04.745 line:80%
What's wrong?

00:49:04.828 --> 00:49:06.455 line:80%
-It's nothing.
-I…

00:49:07.247 --> 00:49:11.085 line:80%
I know you hate others meddling,
but let me meddle just this once.

00:49:11.168 --> 00:49:14.213 line:80%
What's wrong? I'm honestly worried.

00:49:14.296 --> 00:49:15.464 line:80%
[sighs]

00:49:17.883 --> 00:49:21.011 line:80%
Then, let's sit for a moment.

00:49:21.637 --> 00:49:23.138 line:80%
[groans] My legs…

00:49:23.222 --> 00:49:24.431 line:80%
[groaning]

00:49:24.974 --> 00:49:26.558 line:80%
Let's sit for a while.

00:49:28.185 --> 00:49:29.395 line:80%
[groans softly]

00:49:32.606 --> 00:49:33.607 line:80%
[Chan clears throat]

00:49:36.026 --> 00:49:37.569 line:80%
I heard a voice.

00:49:39.655 --> 00:49:41.532 line:80%
[♪ soft emotional music playing]

00:49:43.993 --> 00:49:45.035 line:80%
[woman] Ran!

00:49:49.957 --> 00:49:52.084 line:80%
[Haran] <i>Someone called my name,</i>
<i>so I went to look.</i>

00:49:53.085 --> 00:49:54.253 line:80%
[woman] Ran!

00:49:57.715 --> 00:49:58.716 line:80%
[both chuckle]

00:49:58.799 --> 00:49:59.967 line:80%
KIM RAN

00:50:00.050 --> 00:50:01.593 line:80%
-I'll try it first.
-Okay.

00:50:02.636 --> 00:50:06.098 line:80%
[Haran] <i>But her voice</i>
<i>was so similar to my mom's.</i>

00:50:07.308 --> 00:50:09.226 line:80%
Ran, come here.

00:50:14.356 --> 00:50:17.401 line:80%
[Haran] <i>It sounded like</i>
<i>my mom was actually calling me,</i>

00:50:18.485 --> 00:50:20.195 line:80%
<i>so I burst into tears.</i>

00:50:20.279 --> 00:50:21.280 line:80%
[young Haran] Mom.

00:50:24.199 --> 00:50:26.160 line:80%
[Haran] <i>Ran, Ran.</i>

00:50:26.243 --> 00:50:28.871 line:80%
<i>My mom always called me like that.</i>

00:50:32.124 --> 00:50:34.501 line:80%
[♪ music continues]

00:50:40.716 --> 00:50:42.718 line:80%
-[Haran's mom] I like this song!
-[Haran's dad] Mmm?

00:50:42.801 --> 00:50:44.845 line:80%
-It's Hadam's favorite song.
-[♪ song playing on radio]

00:50:44.928 --> 00:50:46.305 line:80%
-[Hadam exclaims]
-It is.

00:50:46.388 --> 00:50:47.890 line:80%
[both parents chuckle]

00:50:47.973 --> 00:50:49.892 line:80%
Hadam, do you want
to say hi to your sisters?

00:50:49.975 --> 00:50:51.769 line:80%
-Yes.
-Okay.

00:50:51.852 --> 00:50:52.978 line:80%
Hi!

00:50:53.062 --> 00:50:55.898 line:80%
-[Haran's mom] Hi.
-[Haran's dad] They look so excited.

00:50:56.440 --> 00:50:58.734 line:80%
[Haran and Nana chuckle]

00:50:58.817 --> 00:51:00.569 line:80%
[♪ song continues playing]

00:51:00.653 --> 00:51:01.654 line:80%
[exclaims]

00:51:05.032 --> 00:51:06.825 line:80%
-[♪ music stops]
-[tires screech]

00:51:07.201 --> 00:51:08.202 line:80%
[gasps]

00:51:13.874 --> 00:51:15.751 line:80%
-[Hayeong screams]
-[Nana breathes shakily]

00:51:15.834 --> 00:51:16.960 line:80%
Mom.

00:51:17.503 --> 00:51:18.504 line:80%
Dad.

00:51:18.587 --> 00:51:19.672 line:80%
[rattling]

00:51:19.755 --> 00:51:20.964 line:80%
Dad…

00:51:22.174 --> 00:51:24.176 line:80%
[♪ somber music playing]

00:51:36.563 --> 00:51:38.482 line:80%
Dad! Dad!

00:51:39.149 --> 00:51:40.150 line:80%
Dad!

00:51:40.901 --> 00:51:42.236 line:80%
[Haran breathing heavily]

00:51:42.319 --> 00:51:43.862 line:80%
Mom!

00:51:43.946 --> 00:51:45.114 line:80%
Mom, get up! Mom!

00:51:45.906 --> 00:51:48.575 line:80%
Mom!

00:51:51.662 --> 00:51:52.705 line:80%
Please!

00:51:53.455 --> 00:51:55.749 line:80%
-Mom!
-Dad.

00:51:55.833 --> 00:51:57.292 line:80%
[Hayeong crying] Dad!

00:51:57.376 --> 00:51:59.169 line:80%
[Haran crying] Help us!

00:51:59.253 --> 00:52:01.296 line:80%
[♪ somber music continuing]

00:52:01.380 --> 00:52:04.508 line:80%
[Haran] <i>They said the driver</i>
<i>suddenly had a cardiac arrest.</i>

00:52:05.175 --> 00:52:07.094 line:80%
<i>Both my parents died on the spot,</i>

00:52:07.886 --> 00:52:11.432 line:80%
<i>right in front of me.</i>

00:52:13.809 --> 00:52:15.894 line:80%
I know she wasn't calling me,

00:52:16.478 --> 00:52:18.439 line:80%
and that I was mistaken,

00:52:20.441 --> 00:52:22.401 line:80%
but when I heard her voice,

00:52:22.484 --> 00:52:25.654 line:80%
I think I felt happy for a split second.

00:52:26.697 --> 00:52:28.699 line:80%
-I know that sounds strange.
-[♪ music fades]

00:52:29.241 --> 00:52:31.118 line:80%
Well, you felt like someone you miss

00:52:31.952 --> 00:52:33.871 line:80%
called your name.

00:52:35.497 --> 00:52:38.834 line:80%
[♪ soft emotional music playing]

00:52:39.501 --> 00:52:40.919 line:80%
-[Haran] <i>Chan.</i>
-[EKG beeping]

00:52:41.003 --> 00:52:42.504 line:80%
<i>-I love you.</i>
-[EKG beeping rapidly]

00:52:42.588 --> 00:52:43.964 line:20%
<i>-I love you, Chan.</i>
-[beeping stops]

00:52:44.048 --> 00:52:45.966 line:80%
[breathing deeply]

00:52:47.092 --> 00:52:49.303 line:80%
[♪ music continues]

00:52:49.845 --> 00:52:51.972 line:80%
It's not strange at all.

00:52:57.936 --> 00:52:58.937 line:80%
Ah…

00:53:00.314 --> 00:53:03.400 line:80%
[groans] I guess I was showing off again.

00:53:03.484 --> 00:53:04.485 line:80%
[chuckles softly]

00:53:06.320 --> 00:53:07.821 line:80%
I'm sorry.

00:53:07.905 --> 00:53:08.906 line:80%
What?

00:53:09.448 --> 00:53:11.825 line:80%
Oh. It's fine.
I was almost done looking around.

00:53:11.909 --> 00:53:13.869 line:80%
I'm really sorry

00:53:15.120 --> 00:53:16.872 line:80%
for lashing out at you until now.

00:53:18.374 --> 00:53:20.751 line:80%
You did nothing wrong,

00:53:22.294 --> 00:53:24.046 line:80%
but I was so harsh on you.

00:53:24.880 --> 00:53:26.590 line:80%
And those fruit syrups last time…

00:53:27.716 --> 00:53:29.218 line:80%
I'm really sorry.

00:53:30.135 --> 00:53:32.638 line:80%
No, it's all my fault.

00:53:32.721 --> 00:53:36.183 line:80%
I shouldn't have said all that stuff
about being friends.

00:53:36.266 --> 00:53:37.393 line:80%
I'm sorry.

00:53:37.935 --> 00:53:39.520 line:80%
Look, you're doing it again.

00:53:40.604 --> 00:53:42.606 line:80%
I'm the one who's weird.

00:53:43.732 --> 00:53:48.112 line:80%
I keep making other people apologize
when I'm the one who's sorry.

00:53:48.195 --> 00:53:50.906 line:80%
I know I'm being rude and cruel,

00:53:50.990 --> 00:53:54.994 line:80%
and I want to change,
but I don't know how.

00:53:55.786 --> 00:53:59.248 line:80%
Getting close to someone
is really difficult…

00:54:00.374 --> 00:54:01.417 line:80%
No,

00:54:02.376 --> 00:54:04.086 line:80%
it's scary for me.

00:54:08.590 --> 00:54:11.635 line:80%
Losing someone you care about
without warning

00:54:12.386 --> 00:54:14.096 line:80%
<i>is already painful enough…</i>

00:54:14.179 --> 00:54:16.390 line:80%
[siren wailing]

00:54:16.473 --> 00:54:20.311 line:80%
<i>...but it happened to me again…</i>
<i>so cruelly.</i>

00:54:22.104 --> 00:54:24.023 line:80%
So I run away before it happens.

00:54:25.691 --> 00:54:29.695 line:80%
Because I feel like I'll crumble
if that happens again.

00:54:32.656 --> 00:54:34.575 line:80%
If no one is special to me,

00:54:35.617 --> 00:54:37.828 line:80%
then at least nothing bad will happen.

00:54:40.456 --> 00:54:44.335 line:80%
At first, I put up walls
to protect myself,

00:54:45.669 --> 00:54:48.255 line:80%
but now, I feel like
I'm trapped behind them.

00:54:51.258 --> 00:54:52.259 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:54:53.635 --> 00:54:56.305 line:80%
Darn it. I must be crazy.
What am I doing? [sniffling]

00:54:59.266 --> 00:55:00.601 line:80%
You're so strange.

00:55:01.226 --> 00:55:02.561 line:80%
[stammers] Me?

00:55:04.480 --> 00:55:08.984 line:80%
As soon as the three months is over,
I'll disappear without a trace.

00:55:09.985 --> 00:55:12.863 line:80%
Maybe it's because you'll leave soon.

00:55:13.656 --> 00:55:14.657 line:80%
Hm.

00:55:15.240 --> 00:55:16.408 line:80%
Huh?

00:55:19.286 --> 00:55:21.246 line:80%
-[♪ lighthearted music playing]
-[gasps softly]

00:55:23.582 --> 00:55:25.167 line:80%
That's beautiful.

00:55:25.250 --> 00:55:26.377 line:80%
[Chan chuckles]

00:55:28.128 --> 00:55:29.338 line:80%
[grunts, inhales sharply]

00:55:29.421 --> 00:55:31.340 line:80%
I should take photos. [clears throat]

00:55:32.716 --> 00:55:35.052 line:80%
Huh? My bag.

00:55:35.135 --> 00:55:36.720 line:80%
I left my bag behind.

00:55:36.804 --> 00:55:38.764 line:80%
I'll go and get it…

00:55:38.847 --> 00:55:40.015 line:80%
Wait. What are you doing?

00:55:40.599 --> 00:55:43.060 line:80%
-What?
-Don't you need your bag, too?

00:55:43.143 --> 00:55:44.144 line:80%
[gasps]

00:55:44.228 --> 00:55:46.188 line:80%
[exclaiming] My bag! Oh, gosh!

00:55:46.772 --> 00:55:48.357 line:80%
Come on. [clears throat]

00:55:49.191 --> 00:55:51.193 line:80%
[♪ lighthearted music continues]

00:55:59.034 --> 00:56:00.494 line:80%
[Hayeong] I also just got off work.

00:56:02.121 --> 00:56:03.497 line:80%
-[beeps]
-[Hayeong] Oh.

00:56:03.580 --> 00:56:05.374 line:80%
-You're coming here?
-[♪ music ends]

00:56:05.457 --> 00:56:06.917 line:80%
Sure, let's meet up.

00:56:07.626 --> 00:56:10.671 line:80%
But, Mr. Cha, are you walking here?

00:56:10.754 --> 00:56:13.590 line:80%
Wow, that's so close. I'll see you in 10--

00:56:13.674 --> 00:56:15.801 line:80%
Ms. Kim wants you in her office.

00:56:16.885 --> 00:56:19.221 line:80%
-Me? Um…
-[♪ suspenseful music playing]

00:56:19.304 --> 00:56:21.390 line:80%
Oh. Sorry, but can you wait--

00:56:21.473 --> 00:56:24.351 line:80%
[Taeseok]
She wants to see you immediately.

00:56:24.435 --> 00:56:26.061 line:80%
And it will take a while.

00:56:26.145 --> 00:56:27.187 line:80%
Why?

00:56:28.230 --> 00:56:29.231 line:80%
[sighs]

00:56:30.149 --> 00:56:35.946 line:80%
[stutters] I'm sorry, something came up.
I don't think we can meet today.

00:56:36.030 --> 00:56:37.656 line:80%
I'll call you later. Bye.

00:56:38.490 --> 00:56:40.826 line:80%
-[elevator dings]
-Why is she asking for me?

00:56:41.452 --> 00:56:43.495 line:80%
[♪ music continues]

00:56:44.204 --> 00:56:45.873 line:80%
You'll know when you get there.

00:56:47.166 --> 00:56:48.542 line:80%
Did I do something wrong?

00:56:52.713 --> 00:56:54.673 line:80%
Excuse me.

00:56:55.257 --> 00:56:56.550 line:80%
I heard you were…

00:56:57.384 --> 00:57:00.095 line:80%
[stutters] looking for me…

00:57:01.055 --> 00:57:02.222 line:80%
Where is she?

00:57:02.306 --> 00:57:03.307 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:57:04.308 --> 00:57:08.687 line:80%
Mmm… Then I'll refer to the <i>dancheong</i>
we saw today and…

00:57:09.271 --> 00:57:10.981 line:80%
-Hey, Donggu.
-Hey!

00:57:11.065 --> 00:57:12.316 line:80%
Were you practicing soccer?

00:57:12.399 --> 00:57:14.193 line:80%
-Yes. But, Chan…
-Yes?

00:57:14.276 --> 00:57:16.654 line:80%
This thing you did with the ball.

00:57:16.737 --> 00:57:19.239 line:80%
Can you show us again?

00:57:19.323 --> 00:57:20.616 line:80%
Again?

00:57:21.200 --> 00:57:22.660 line:80%
Hmm. [sighs]

00:57:24.078 --> 00:57:26.163 line:80%
[inhales sharply]
Since my dear Donggu is asking,

00:57:26.246 --> 00:57:27.790 line:80%
-of course, I'll do it for you.
-Yes!

00:57:27.873 --> 00:57:30.084 line:80%
Watch. [clears throat]

00:57:30.167 --> 00:57:31.335 line:80%
Here.

00:57:31.418 --> 00:57:32.544 line:80%
[children exclaim]

00:57:32.628 --> 00:57:35.339 line:80%
-You're so good. Wow!
-You're amazing.

00:57:35.422 --> 00:57:36.674 line:80%
You're like Son Heungmin!

00:57:36.757 --> 00:57:38.467 line:80%
[exclaims] Nice, Donggu.

00:57:38.550 --> 00:57:39.802 line:80%
[chuckles softly]

00:57:39.885 --> 00:57:43.222 line:80%
But my shoes aren't comfy,
and I'm with someone today,

00:57:43.305 --> 00:57:44.932 line:80%
-so that's it for today.
-[Donggu] Okay.

00:57:45.015 --> 00:57:46.266 line:80%
[Chan] Here you go.

00:57:46.350 --> 00:57:47.810 line:80%
-See you later.
-[Chan] Okay.

00:57:47.893 --> 00:57:49.144 line:80%
Bye.

00:57:49.228 --> 00:57:50.646 line:80%
-Bye.
-[children] Bye.

00:57:50.729 --> 00:57:52.064 line:80%
-[Donggu] Bye.
-[Haran chuckles]

00:57:52.773 --> 00:57:54.566 line:80%
Let's go have pizza!

00:57:55.150 --> 00:57:57.319 line:80%
He's Kim Donggu.
He lives in the neighborhood.

00:57:57.403 --> 00:58:00.072 line:80%
We started talking and grew close.
We really clicked.

00:58:00.155 --> 00:58:02.574 line:80%
-[cell phone vibrates]
-Hang on.

00:58:03.909 --> 00:58:07.371 line:80%
It's Je Raemee. [chuckles]
It's about our bowling game.

00:58:07.454 --> 00:58:10.374 line:80%
You really are a human capybara.

00:58:11.375 --> 00:58:14.586 line:80%
A capybara?
The animal that looks like a huge rat?

00:58:14.670 --> 00:58:19.258 line:80%
[inhales sharply] Well… I've never heard
that I look like a rat before.

00:58:19.341 --> 00:58:23.303 line:80%
Oh. I just meant how you get close
to everyone around you.

00:58:23.387 --> 00:58:25.472 line:80%
Look it up. You're exactly the same.

00:58:30.394 --> 00:58:33.355 line:80%
Anyway, thanks for everything today.
Let's head home now.

00:58:33.439 --> 00:58:34.690 line:80%
I'll get going.

00:58:46.618 --> 00:58:48.620 line:80%
[♪ soft emotional music playing]

00:58:53.208 --> 00:58:55.210 line:80%
[Chan panting]

00:58:56.545 --> 00:58:59.465 line:80%
Let me make it clear
since you seem to have misunderstood.

00:59:00.257 --> 00:59:03.594 line:80%
It's true that I want
to get close to everyone.

00:59:04.678 --> 00:59:07.890 line:80%
But I meant something else
when I asked us to be friends.

00:59:11.727 --> 00:59:12.978 line:80%
I wanted to show you…

00:59:14.355 --> 00:59:15.856 line:80%
that there's another way.

00:59:16.940 --> 00:59:20.027 line:80%
<i>At first, I was curious</i>
<i>why you were standing</i>

00:59:20.110 --> 00:59:22.738 line:80%
in front of that winter painting
by yourself.

00:59:22.821 --> 00:59:25.574 line:80%
And while working with you
and watching you,

00:59:25.658 --> 00:59:28.243 line:80%
I thought that perhaps…

00:59:29.244 --> 00:59:33.582 line:80%
you thought the person standing alone
in that painting was you.

00:59:37.961 --> 00:59:42.007 line:80%
So I know it's not my place,
but I wanted to show you something…

00:59:44.927 --> 00:59:46.762 line:80%
that someone else showed me before.

00:59:48.138 --> 00:59:52.393 line:80%
<i>You know, I used to go to bed</i>
<i>every night as a child</i>

00:59:52.476 --> 00:59:53.978 line:80%
<i>hoping that day would be the last.</i>

00:59:55.437 --> 00:59:56.981 line:80%
<i>But I kept waking up,</i>

00:59:57.773 --> 01:00:01.193 line:80%
<i>and I lived like a corpse…</i>

01:00:01.276 --> 01:00:02.945 line:80%
[bully 1 in English] He's so weird.
Welcome him.

01:00:03.862 --> 01:00:05.864 line:80%
[bullies laughing]

01:00:06.740 --> 01:00:08.117 line:80%
[bully 2] No, he's a crazy guy.

01:00:08.242 --> 01:00:09.827 line:80%
[students whisper, laugh]

01:00:10.536 --> 01:00:12.287 line:80%
[Chan in Korean]
<i>…with no hope, expression, or color.</i>

01:00:12.371 --> 01:00:14.373 line:80%
[♪ music continues]

01:00:15.958 --> 01:00:18.335 line:80%
<i>Then when I truly thought</i>
<i>it didn't matter if I died</i>

01:00:19.253 --> 01:00:20.629 line:80%
<i>and decided to end everything…</i>

01:00:20.713 --> 01:00:23.090 line:80%
[pinging]

01:00:25.926 --> 01:00:26.927 line:80%
[groans]

01:00:27.011 --> 01:00:29.388 line:80%
<i>-...someone suddenly talked to me.</i>
-[♪ music fades]

01:00:29.471 --> 01:00:30.472 line:80%
<i>Purely by coincidence.</i>

01:00:30.556 --> 01:00:31.890 line:80%
"You're…

01:00:34.643 --> 01:00:36.145 line:80%
my savior."

01:00:36.228 --> 01:00:38.856 line:80%
[sighs, groans]

01:00:40.274 --> 01:00:41.817 line:80%
<i>Congratulations, and…</i>

01:00:43.027 --> 01:00:44.528 line:80%
<i>you…</i>

01:00:44.987 --> 01:00:45.988 line:80%
[sighs]

01:00:46.071 --> 01:00:47.531 line:80%
[keyboard thudding]

01:00:47.614 --> 01:00:50.868 line:80%
<i>saved me as well.</i>

01:00:52.077 --> 01:00:54.913 line:80%
<i>That coincidence made me stop,</i>

01:00:55.956 --> 01:00:58.459 line:80%
<i>and my daily life</i>
<i>started changing as well.</i>

01:00:59.168 --> 01:01:01.086 line:80%
[♪ romantic song playing]

01:01:06.050 --> 01:01:09.219 line:80%
[Haran] <i>I finally got the sketch sample</i>
<i>for my design.</i>

01:01:09.303 --> 01:01:12.681 line:80%
<i>Make some noise!</i>
<i>It's all thanks to this pen.</i>

01:01:12.765 --> 01:01:15.893 line:80%
[Chan] <i>The words that person said to me</i>
<i>made me smile.</i>

01:01:16.602 --> 01:01:19.647 line:80%
[Haran] <i>Thank you for helping me</i>
<i>not give up on what I love.</i>

01:01:20.314 --> 01:01:22.149 line:80%
<i>For giving me a reason to keep going.</i>

01:01:22.900 --> 01:01:25.778 line:80%
[Chan] <i>For the first time,</i>
<i>I started looking forward to the next day.</i>

01:01:33.827 --> 01:01:35.120 line:80%
[sighing]

01:01:38.457 --> 01:01:39.500 line:80%
<i>And…</i>

01:01:40.459 --> 01:01:42.461 line:80%
<i>I wanted to find a reason to keep going...</i>

01:01:43.337 --> 01:01:44.380 line:80%
[sighs]

01:01:44.463 --> 01:01:48.842 line:80%
<i>...thanks to that person</i>
<i>who kept reaching out and talking to me.</i>

01:02:05.317 --> 01:02:09.321 line:80%
<i>So… you can overcome it.</i>

01:02:09.947 --> 01:02:11.490 line:80%
<i>Once you know how,</i>

01:02:12.616 --> 01:02:14.827 line:80%
<i>you'll be able to escape on your own.</i>

01:02:15.369 --> 01:02:19.498 line:80%
<i>I learned it through that person,</i>
<i>so I wanted to show you, too.</i>

01:02:19.581 --> 01:02:20.582 line:80%
[♪ song continues]

01:02:25.838 --> 01:02:27.548 line:80%
<i>I've also been trapped</i>

01:02:28.132 --> 01:02:30.801 line:80%
in a long winter all by myself.

01:02:35.806 --> 01:02:37.349 line:80%
[Chan] Is his name Mong? [gasps]

01:02:38.976 --> 01:02:40.978 line:80%
You're so cute, Mong.

01:02:42.187 --> 01:02:43.439 line:80%
Let's take a picture.

01:02:44.523 --> 01:02:47.067 line:80%
I can't hear on this side.

01:02:48.068 --> 01:02:49.570 line:80%
<i>I wanted to get close</i>

01:02:49.653 --> 01:02:51.572 line:80%
<i>-because you reminded me of my past.</i>
-[gasps]

01:02:51.655 --> 01:02:52.656 line:80%
[sighs]

01:02:53.032 --> 01:02:54.783 line:80%
[Chan] <i>I'm sorry</i>
<i>if I made you uncomfortable.</i>

01:02:55.200 --> 01:02:57.161 line:80%
[Chan] Three. Hey, Mong.
Look at the camera.

01:02:57.244 --> 01:02:59.663 line:80%
<i>-But I guess that doesn't matter.</i>
-One, two, three.

01:02:59.747 --> 01:03:00.748 line:80%
[camera clicks]

01:03:04.960 --> 01:03:05.961 line:80%
[Haran] Excuse me!

01:03:07.796 --> 01:03:09.048 line:80%
What?

01:03:10.507 --> 01:03:11.675 line:80%
What is it?

01:03:11.759 --> 01:03:12.760 line:80%
[Haran] Take this.

01:03:14.386 --> 01:03:15.387 line:80%
Oh…

01:03:17.514 --> 01:03:20.142 line:80%
You didn't get to drink your favorite milk
because of me.

01:03:24.730 --> 01:03:25.731 line:80%
[♪ song fades]

01:03:29.693 --> 01:03:33.197 line:80%
Is your suggestion still valid?

01:03:33.781 --> 01:03:34.823 line:80%
What?

01:03:35.407 --> 01:03:37.743 line:80%
[stutters] Hang on, I'll go over there.

01:03:37.826 --> 01:03:39.036 line:80%
[Haran stutters]

01:03:39.119 --> 01:03:40.579 line:80%
No, I'll go.

01:03:54.134 --> 01:03:56.595 line:80%
Sorry, I didn't hear you.
What did you say?

01:03:57.221 --> 01:03:58.639 line:80%
And what's with this milk?

01:03:59.640 --> 01:04:02.059 line:80%
Is it still valid?

01:04:02.142 --> 01:04:03.143 line:80%
What?

01:04:04.603 --> 01:04:06.188 line:80%
Oh. The expiration date?

01:04:06.271 --> 01:04:07.481 line:80%
Not the milk.

01:04:08.107 --> 01:04:10.901 line:80%
I mean… being friends.

01:04:10.985 --> 01:04:12.653 line:80%
The three-month trial.

01:04:13.779 --> 01:04:15.280 line:80%
Is that still valid?

01:04:19.702 --> 01:04:21.412 line:80%
I'd like to learn.

01:04:22.204 --> 01:04:23.956 line:80%
Can you show me?

01:04:25.624 --> 01:04:28.919 line:80%
You said someone showed you
how to escape from winter.

01:04:32.423 --> 01:04:33.632 line:80%
[♪ soft music playing]

01:04:33.716 --> 01:04:34.717 line:80%
Uh…

01:04:34.800 --> 01:04:36.677 line:80%
I guess I'm too late.

01:04:37.761 --> 01:04:40.889 line:80%
[shakily] I understand.
I was so cruel to you.

01:04:40.973 --> 01:04:43.559 line:80%
I'm so pathetic,
going back and forth like this.

01:04:43.642 --> 01:04:46.854 line:80%
I'm just curious
whether I can change as well.

01:04:46.937 --> 01:04:51.150 line:80%
And I thought it would be okay
if there's a time limit.

01:04:52.067 --> 01:04:54.069 line:80%
Never mind. Just forget--

01:04:54.153 --> 01:04:55.362 line:80%
It's valid.

01:04:58.824 --> 01:05:00.617 line:80%
It's still valid.

01:05:01.535 --> 01:05:02.536 line:80%
Ah…

01:05:03.537 --> 01:05:04.997 line:80%
It's valid…

01:05:06.832 --> 01:05:08.834 line:80%
Well, I…

01:05:09.960 --> 01:05:14.423 line:80%
The nurse told me
that if I keep this on for too long,

01:05:14.506 --> 01:05:17.760 line:80%
I wouldn't be able to heal naturally.

01:05:18.427 --> 01:05:19.720 line:80%
So I thought

01:05:19.803 --> 01:05:22.473 line:80%
I shouldn't stay trapped
behind my own barriers…

01:05:23.307 --> 01:05:26.518 line:80%
[chuckles] I'm saying this because I…

01:05:26.602 --> 01:05:31.357 line:80%
Then, it's okay
to be really nice to you now, right?

01:05:35.319 --> 01:05:36.320 line:80%
Just three months.

01:05:37.279 --> 01:05:38.530 line:80%
A trial period.

01:05:41.158 --> 01:05:43.369 line:80%
I'll do my best to learn, too.

01:05:43.452 --> 01:05:44.453 line:80%
[sighs]

01:05:45.704 --> 01:05:46.705 line:80%
[smacks lips]

01:05:46.789 --> 01:05:47.790 line:80%
[in English] Okay.

01:05:49.208 --> 01:05:50.793 line:80%
[in Korean] Then let's do this.

01:05:50.876 --> 01:05:52.878 line:80%
It'll be like we're on a spring picnic.

01:05:53.545 --> 01:05:54.588 line:80%
Let's have fun.

01:06:02.763 --> 01:06:05.391 line:80%
[high-pitched ringing]

01:06:05.474 --> 01:06:06.475 line:80%
[groans softly]

01:06:10.896 --> 01:06:13.107 line:80%
[high-pitched ringing]

01:06:13.190 --> 01:06:14.233 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

01:06:14.733 --> 01:06:15.859 line:80%
[explosion]

01:06:20.864 --> 01:06:22.866 line:80%
[high-pitched ringing]

01:06:26.954 --> 01:06:28.163 line:80%
[ringing fades]

01:06:31.166 --> 01:06:33.085 line:80%
[♪ romantic song playing]

01:06:33.168 --> 01:06:34.920 line:80%
IN YOUR RADIANT SEASON

01:06:58.986 --> 01:07:01.030 line:20%
[Chan] <i>It was my first time</i>
<i>hearing that sound.</i>

01:07:01.113 --> 01:07:04.199 line:20%
[doctor] <i>What if there is still</i>
<i>an empty spot in your memories</i>

01:07:04.283 --> 01:07:05.659 line:20%
<i>that you're not aware of?</i>

01:07:05.743 --> 01:07:08.912 line:20%
[Haran] <i>I told you a secret,</i>
<i>so next time it's your turn.</i>

01:07:08.996 --> 01:07:11.790 line:20%
[Yougyum] <i>It seemed like</i>
<i>she might have dementia.</i>

01:07:11.874 --> 01:07:15.085 line:20%
[Nana] <i>So please…</i>
<i>Keep this a secret for now.</i>

01:07:15.169 --> 01:07:17.379 line:20%
[Hayeong] <i>It can't be, right?</i>

01:07:17.463 --> 01:07:19.965 line:20%
[woman] <i>You have a crush</i>
<i>on Ms. Song, don't you?</i>

01:07:20.049 --> 01:07:21.342 line:20%
[Haran] <i>"That person"?</i>

01:07:21.425 --> 01:07:23.177 line:20%
-[Haran gasping] <i>I…</i>
-[car horn blares]

01:07:23.260 --> 01:07:24.970 line:20%
<i>...shouldn't have asked you for a ride.</i>

01:07:25.804 --> 01:07:28.932 line:80%
[Chan] <i>As long as she becomes happy,</i>
<i>I don't care what happens.</i>

01:07:31.977 --> 01:07:32.978 line:80%
[♪ song fades]

01:07:33.062 --> 01:07:35.064 line:80%
[♪ theme music playing]

01:07:40.944 --> 01:07:41.945 line:80%
IN YOUR RADIANT SEASON

01:07:42.029 --> 01:07:43.030 line:80%
Translated by Juyoung Park